/* ==========================================================
   TECHNO JAPAN — HUB DATA

   Lightweight shared data for hub pages. Detail-only content stays in data.js.
   ========================================================== */

const ARTISTS = [{"id":"dj-nobu","name":"DJ Nobu","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/dj-nobu.webp","bio":"DJ Nobuは東京を拠点に活動するテクノアーティストで、日本のアンダーグラウンドな電子音楽シーンに深く根ざしている。精緻な技術的アプローチと空間的なサウンドデザインで知られ、ミニマルな美学を軸に日本のテクノの展開を体現している。","bio_en":"DJ Nobu is a Tokyo-based techno artist deeply embedded in Japan's underground electronic music scene. Known for his precise technical approach and atmospheric sound design, he represents the evolution of Japanese techno with a distinctly minimalist aesthetic.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/dj_nobu_ft/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/djnobu_bitta","bandcamp":"https://dj-nobu.bandcamp.com/album/sh"}},{"id":"wata-igarashi","name":"WATA IGARASHI","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/wata-igarashi.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"東京を拠点とするプロデューサー/DJ。ヒプノティックでサイケデリックなテクノを手がける。Midgar、The Bunker NY、そして自身のレーベルMeditateから作品をリリース。深く渦を巻くようなサウンドは、超越的でありながら容赦がない。","bio_en":"Tokyo-based producer and DJ crafting hypnotic, psychedelic techno. Releases on Midgar, The Bunker NY, and his own Meditate label. His sound is a deep, spiraling journey — transcendent and relentless.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/wataigarashi/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/wataigarashi","bandcamp":"https://wataigarashi.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"kotsu","name":"KOTSU","city":"OSAKA","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HOUSE / MINIMAL","image":"images/artists/kotsu.webp","bio":"関西アンダーグラウンドに深く根ざした大阪のセレクター。ディープハウス、ミニマル、マイクロハウスの間を自在に行き来するセットを展開する。CIRCUS Osakaの常連であり、日本各地のクラブサーキットにも定期的に登場している。","bio_en":"Osaka selector with deep roots in the Kansai underground. Fluid sets moving between deep house, minimal, and micro-house. A fixture at CIRCUS Osaka and a regular across Japan's club circuit.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/kotsu_dj/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/kotsu"}},{"id":"ken-ishii","name":"KEN ISHII","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/ken-ishii.webp","bio":"90年代初頭から日本のテクノを牽引してきたパイオニア。R&S RecordsやSublimeからのリリースを通じて国際的に認知される。日本の電子音楽シーンに与えた影響は計り知れない、生けるレジェンド。","bio_en":"Pioneer of Japanese techno since the early '90s. Internationally recognized through releases on R&S Records and Sublime. A living legend whose influence on Japan's electronic music scene is immeasurable.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/kenishiiofficial/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/ken-ishii-70drums","bandcamp":"https://kenishii.bandcamp.com/","website":"https://kenishii.com"}},{"id":"dj-miku","name":"DJ MIKU","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/dj-miku.webp","bio":"80年代のニューウェーブ、エレクトロ、テクノを出発点に持つDJ/プロデューサー。90年代初頭、ウェアハウスパーティー KEY-ENERGY のレジデントとして、東京のアンダーグラウンドが形になっていく現場に立ち会った。1996年に NewStage Records を設立し、2012年からは野外フェス GLOBAL ARK を主宰。掛ける側から、場をつくる側へと軸足を広げてきた人である。","bio_en":"A DJ and producer rooted in 80s new wave, electro and techno. In the early 90s he was a resident at the KEY-ENERGY warehouse parties, present as Tokyo's underground took shape. He founded NewStage Records in 1996 and has run the open-air festival GLOBAL ARK since 2012, widening his role from playing the music to building the place where it happens.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/djmikumahirojazu/","website":"http://djmiku.com/"}},{"id":"dj-kensei","name":"DJ KENSEI","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO/HOUSE","image":"images/artists/dj-kensei.webp","bio":"東京生まれのDJ/プロデューサー/ビートメイカー。80年代半ばに活動を始め、キャリアは35年を超える。ミックスCD、アナログ盤、テープと、形を選ばず作品を残し、リミキサーやプロデューサーとしての仕事も長い。時代が何度も入れ替わるあいだ、東京の現場に立ち続けている。","bio_en":"A Tokyo-born DJ, producer and beat-maker who began in the mid-80s, with a career now spanning more than 35 years. He has left work across mix CDs, vinyl and tapes without preferring any one format, alongside long-running work as a remixer and producer. Through several changes of era, he has stayed on Tokyo's floors.","links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/dj_kensei"}},{"id":"dj-yogurt","name":"DJ Yogurt","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/dj-yogurt.webp","bio":"1996年にDJを始め、1998年にユニット UPSETS とレーベル UPSET RECORDINGS を設立。その前後、ゴアやパンガン島、ロンドン、アムステルダムのレイヴを渡り歩いている。東京のレコード店で15年間働いた経験も選盤の土台にあり現場に立ち続け、リリースも途切れることがない。日本のアンダーグラウンドを、量と継続で支えてきたDJだ。","bio_en":"DJing since 1996, he founded the unit UPSETS and the label UPSET RECORDINGS in 1998, having passed through raves in Goa, Koh Phangan, London and Amsterdam along the way. Fifteen years working in Tokyo record stores still shows in his selection. He plays over 70 parties a year and keeps releasing, supporting Japan's underground through sheer volume and persistence.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/djyogurt0107/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/djyogurt-1","bandcamp":"https://upsetrecordings.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"hidai","name":"Hidai","city":"TOKYo","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/hidai.webp","bio":"主に野外で活動しているSoundsystem crew  OtOdashiのDJ。サウンドシステムを持ち込みフロアをデザインし、変幻自在なスタイルで様々な内外のイベントに参加している。TEKNIVALやアンダーグラウンドの超越DIYパーティから強く影響を受け、OtOdashi、BEACHWHISTLE、Black Sheep、PARALLEL WORLD等々の、非エントランス式イベントに積極的に参加し、その風潮を高めてきた。そこで培ってきた体感を元に、プロモーターやオーガナイザーとしての活動も多岐に渡り、今では、ハイクオリティ重視な世界観を表現することに重きをおいている。DJとしての音楽は、hiphopからクロスオーバーし、生楽器、自然音、不自然音、electroなどの、全ての音にルーツがあり、Technoを中心に様々な音源を駆使し積み重ね、気宇壮大なgrooveを創造する。","bio_en":"A DJ with OtOdashi, a soundsystem crew active primarily in outdoor settings. Hauling in their own rig to design the floor itself, he takes part in a wide range of events at home and abroad with a style that shifts shape at will. Drawing strong influence from TEKNIVAL and the transcendent DIY spirit of the underground, he has thrown himself into non-entrance-fee events — OtOdashi, BEACHWHISTLE, Black Sheep, PARALLEL WORLD and more — helping to build that movement's momentum. Building on the instincts honed in those environments, his work as a promoter and organizer spans just as broadly, and these days he places particular weight on articulating a world-view rooted in uncompromising quality. As a DJ, his music crosses over from hip-hop, with roots in every kind of sound — live instrumentation, natural sound, unnatural sound, electro — layering and marshalling a diverse arsenal of material around a core of techno to create a groove of vast, expansive scale.","name_en":"Hidai","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/hidai_otodashi/"}},{"id":"taichi-kawahira","name":"TAICHI KAWAHIRA","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/taichi-kawahira.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"1997年よりライブ、オーガナイズ活動を開始。様々なレーベルより楽曲も勢力的にリリースし、2004年よりサイケデリックかつスペーシーなサウンドを軸としたスタイルでDJ活動をスタート。ヒプノティックでディープな空気の中にストーリー性の高いエモーショナルなセンスを内包し、アップリフティングでトランシーなドライブ力を併せ持つ。様々な音楽フェスティバルへの出演をはじめに都内主要クラブからアンダーグラウンドな場所まで幅広い現場でプレイ。またエレクトロニカ、エクスペリメンタル、アンビエント、アブストラクトを軸とする音楽も得意とし、ギャラリーやアートイベントでの音楽担当など活動の場所は多岐に渡る。 自身主催によるOpen Air Music&Art Festival Brightnessは活動9年目を迎え、クラブシーンやバンドシーンの垣根を飛び越え、多様なカルチャーをクロスオーバーさせるアプローチで独自の立ち位置を獲得しシーンに一石投じている。","bio_en":"Began performing live and organizing events in 1997, releasing music prolifically on a range of labels along the way. In 2004 he launched his DJ career, built around a psychedelic, spacey sound. His sets fold a highly narrative, emotional sensibility into hypnotic, deep atmospheres, while retaining an uplifting, trance-inflected drive. Alongside appearances at numerous music festivals, he has played everywhere from Tokyo's major clubs to the deepest underground spaces. He is equally at home with electronica, experimental, ambient and abstract sounds, and his activities extend to soundtracking galleries and art events.\n\nNow in its ninth year, Open Air Music & Art Festival Brightness — the festival he founded and directs — has carved out a singular position by leaping over the barriers between club and band scenes, taking a crossover approach to diverse cultures and throwing down a challenge to the scene at large.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/taichi_kawahira/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/dj-taichi-kawahira"}},{"id":"tsutomu","name":"TSUTOMU","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/tsutomu.webp","bio":"DJ であり、Sawagi Festival のプロデューサー。代々木公園で開かれる Spring Love 春風の実行委員も務めるなど、フェスの作り手としての顔も持つ。\n掛ける側と、開く側の両方に立ち続けている人である。","bio_en":"A DJ and the producer of Sawagi Festival. He also sits on the organizing committee of Spring Love 春風, held in Yoyogi Park, giving him another face as a builder of festivals.\nHe is someone who has kept one foot on each side: the person putting the records on, and the person opening the doors.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/tsutomu_tabata/"}},{"id":"qmico","name":"Qmico","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/qmico.webp","bio":"東京出身のDJ。2011年にDJを始め、テクノを軸にミニマル、エクスペリメンタル、レフトフィールド、ディープハウスを行き来する。ruralやPARAMOUNTなどの野外フェスや国内各地のクラブに出演し、Peter Van Hoesen、Voiski、Anthony Linellらの公演でサポートを務めてきた。テクノを核にしたパーティー「QUALIA」を主宰する。","bio_en":"Tokyo-born DJ who started playing in 2011. Techno is the anchor, with sets moving through minimal, experimental, leftfield and deep house. Qmico has played outdoor festivals like rural and PARAMOUNT as well as clubs across Japan, supported Peter Van Hoesen, Voiski and Anthony Linell, and runs QUALIA, a party built around techno.","name_en":"Qmico","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/qmico928/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/qmico"}},{"id":"captain-k","name":"Captain K","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/captain-k.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"DOOFING PARK の DJ として活動する。ミニマル、テクノ、プログレッシブ、ブレイクスを掛ける。","bio_en":"A DJ with DOOFING PARK, playing across minimal, techno, progressive and breaks.","name_en":"Captain K","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/captain_k.doofingpark/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/doofingpark"}},{"id":"mimu","name":"Mimu","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/mimu.webp","bio":"日本の野外レイブ PARAMOUNT の創設者のひとり。出演者のキュレーションを手がけながら、自らもDJとしてプレイする。キュレーションを通じて触れてきた幅広い音楽を、自分の筋を通したまま重ね、ひとつの流れに組み上げるセットを聴かせる。","bio_en":"One of the founders of PARAMOUNT, the Japanese open-air rave, where Mimu curates the lineup as well as playing. The sets draw on the range of music that curating the party has brought in, layered into a single story without losing a personal line.","name_en":"Mimu","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/mimu_paramount/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/mimu-511411431"}},{"id":"sakuma","name":"Sakuma","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/sakuma.webp","bio":"新潟でキャリアを始め、2015年から東京を拠点にするDJ。2017年からパーティー「Modest」を主宰し、現在はWOMBを拠点にDJ NOBUやEric Cloutier、Valentino Moraらを迎えてきた。WOMB、VENT、Contactなど都内のクラブでプレイし、2023年にはFUTURE TERRORに続けて出演した。","bio_en":"Tokyo DJ who got his start in his hometown of Niigata and moved to Tokyo in 2015. Since 2017 he has run Modest, a party now based at WOMB that has brought in DJ NOBU, Eric Cloutier and Valentino Mora. He plays WOMB, VENT and Contact around the city, and in 2023 he was booked for consecutive editions of FUTURE TERROR.","name_en":"SAKUMA","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/sakuma_mdst","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/sakuma_modest"}},{"id":"mayudepth","name":"MAYUDEPTH","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/mayudepth.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"東京を拠点とするDJ/プロデューサー。DJ SHUFFLEMASTER 主宰の四季協会から1st EP『Sneakpeek』を発表し、2nd EP『Angels from Hell』では映画監督の石原海を迎えた。ロサンゼルスの ACID CAMP やベルリンの A7A からもリリースしている。DJとしてはテクノにとどまらないアーカイヴと現行の音を組み合わせる。東京のクィア・シーンを支えるパーティー MOTORPOOL を率いる。","bio_en":"A Tokyo DJ and producer whose debut EP \"Sneakpeek\" came out on DJ Shufflemaster's Shiki Kyokai, followed by \"Angels from Hell\" featuring film director Umi Ishihara, and later releases on LA's ACID CAMP and Berlin's A7A. Her sets reach well beyond techno, pairing a deep archive with current records. She also leads MOTORPOOL, a major force in Tokyo's queer scene.","name_en":"MAYUDEPTH","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/mayudepth/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/punkadelix23","bandcamp":"https://mayudepth.bandcamp.com/album/angels-from-hell-feat-umi-ishihara"}},{"id":"choko","name":"CHOKO","city":"KANAGAWA","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HOUSE/TECHNO","image":"images/artists/choko.webp","bio":"Digitalblock に所属する DJ / グラフィックデザイナー。94年よりHIPHOP DJとして活動を開始。\nその後、ハウス/ブレイクビーツ/ジャングル等のダンスミュージックに幅を広げていく。そしてその頃から行き始めた野外パーティに衝撃を受けレイヴカルチャーに傾倒、2001年より地元横浜をベースにアンダーグラウンド・サイケデリック／テクノパーティ[DIGITALBLOCK]をDJ Daijiroと共にスタートする。\nフロアの空気と共鳴しながら進んでいくプレイで、関東を中心に全国各地のコアなフロアを揺らし続けている。またグラフィックデザイナーとしての一面も持ち、様々なParty Flyerのデザインや、AFFKT率いるスペインの人気レーベル[SINCOPAT]のレーベルデザインも手がけている。","bio_en":"A DJ and graphic designer affiliated with Digitalblock. He began his career in 1994 as a hip-hop DJ, later broadening his scope into house, breakbeats, jungle and other strains of dance music. Around the same time, the outdoor parties he started attending left a deep impression on him, drawing him fully into rave culture. In 2001, together with DJ Daijiro, he launched [DIGITALBLOCK] — an underground psychedelic/techno party based in his hometown of Yokohama.\n\nWith a style of play that moves in resonance with the mood of the floor, he continues to rock the country's most dedicated dancefloors, centred on the Kanto region. He is also active as a graphic designer, handling artwork for a wide range of party flyers as well as the label design for [SINCOPAT], the popular Spanish imprint headed by AFFKT.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/choko25digitalblock/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/choko25"}},{"id":"endorphin","name":"endorphin","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO/HOUSE","image":"images/artists/endorphin.webp","bio":"関東を拠点とするDJ/プロデューサー。宇都宮と都内でパーティーをオーガナイズし、渋谷 ENTER のパーティー OPIOID ではレジデントを務める。楽曲制作にも力を入れている。グルーヴィーなテクノを軸に、自ら提唱する「NEO GAL」の考え方と、LOVE, FELLOW, FASHION, SEX の4語を掲げてフロアに立つ。","bio_en":"endorphin is a DJ/producer based in the Kanto region who organizes parties in Utsunomiya and Tokyo and holds a residency at OPIOID at ENTER in Shibuya. She also puts real time into production. Her sets run on groovy techno, carried by the \"NEO GAL\" idea she champions and four words: LOVE, FELLOW, FASHION, SEX.","name_en":"endorphin","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/endorphin__dj/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/endorphin-jp"}},{"id":"antal","name":"Antal","city":"AMSTERDAM","country":"NETHERLANDS","genre":"HOUSE/DISCO","image":"images/artists/antal.webp","bio":"アムステルダムの Rush Hour を1997年から仲間とともに運営する DJ。Rush Hour はレーベル、ディストリビューション、レコード店を抱え、ハウスやテクノの新作と、忘れられていた旧譜の再発を並行して出してきた。本人は自分のスタイルに名前を付けることを好まない。ハウスやテクノから、ファンク、世界各地のディスコまでを同じセットで掛ける。","bio_en":"Antal has run Amsterdam's Rush Hour with a close crew since 1997, a label, distributor and record store that releases new house and techno alongside reissues of long-forgotten records. He prefers not to name his style. A single set can move from house and techno to funk and disco from anywhere in the world.","name_en":"Antal","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/antalheitlager","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/antalrushhour","bandcamp":"https://antalhungary.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"hunee","name":"Hunee","city":"AMSTERDAM","country":"NETHERLANDS","genre":"HOUSE","image":"images/artists/hunee.webp","bio":"韓国出身の両親のもと、ドイツのボーフムで育った DJ／プロデューサー。学校を終えた3日後にベルリンへ移り、レコード店で働きながらクラブで DJ を重ねた。その後アムステルダムへ拠点を戻し、Rush Hour の一員として活動する。Rush Hour、W.T.、Future Times から作品を発表し、2015年に Rush Hour からアルバム『Hunch Music』を出した。レーベル Lifetones も運営する。","bio_en":"Hunee grew up in Bochum, a former industrial city in western Germany, the son of South Korean parents. He moved to Berlin three days after finishing school, digging and working in record shops while DJing around the city. Now back in Amsterdam as part of the Rush Hour family, he has released on Rush Hour, W.T. and Future Times, including the 2015 album Hunch Music, and runs the Lifetones label.","name_en":"Hunee","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/hunchmusic","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/hunee","bandcamp":"https://rushhourmusichunee.bandcamp.com","website":"http://www.hunchmusic.de"}},{"id":"ben-ufo","name":"Ben UFO","country":"UK","genre":"HOUSE/TECHNO/DUBSTEP/BASS","image":"images/artists/ben-ufo.webp","bio":"レーベル Hessle Audio と共に名前が知られてきた UK のDJ。Rinse FM の番組を長年担当している。自身の制作をほとんど持たず、選曲だけで世界の第一線に立った。DJという仕事の定義そのものを、実践で押し広げてきた人である。","bio_en":"A UK DJ who made his name alongside the label Hessle Audio, and a long-running fixture on Rinse FM. With almost no productions of his own, he reached the front rank of the global scene on the strength of his selections alone — a figure who has expanded the very definition of what a DJ does, through practice rather than theory.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/ben___ufo/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/benufo"}},{"id":"daphni","name":"Daphni","country":"CANADA","genre":"HOUSE","image":"images/artists/daphni.webp","bio":"カナダの Daniel Snaith が、Caribou と使い分けるダンスフロア名義。2012年の『Jiaolong』から本格的に動き出した。同名のレーベル Jiaolong を自ら運営しCaribou よりも直接的に、フロアに向けた音を作る。名義を分けることで、二つの時間の流れを持っている作家である。","bio_en":"Daphni is the dancefloor alias that Canada's Daniel Snaith keeps separate from Caribou. The project began in earnest with 2012's *Jiaolong*, and he runs a label of the same name, Jiaolong, himself. The music here is aimed more directly at the floor than anything under Caribou. By splitting his output across two names, he's an artist who moves at two different tempos of time.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/cariboumusic/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/caribouband","bandcamp":"https://caribouband.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"dj-maria","name":"DJ MARIA.","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/dj-maria.webp","bio":"東京の新世代テクノを象徴するDJのひとり。グルーヴィーなテクノとトランスを軸に、ダウンテンポやアンビエントまでを織り込む。一晩を通して物語を立ち上げるような没入感のあるセットで知られる。ベルリンのBerghain、ベルギーのLa Nature、ノルウェーのMonument、ポルトガルのBOOMにも出演している。","bio_en":"One of the DJs who define Tokyo's new-generation techno. Groovy techno and trance sit at the centre, with downtempo and ambient woven through, in sets known for building a narrative across a night. DJ MARIA. has played Berghain in Berlin, La Nature in Belgium, Monument in Norway and BOOM in Portugal.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/mariasatelles/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/djmaria-jp"}},{"id":"dungeoneering","name":"Dungeoneering","country":"JAPAN","genre":"LIVE","image":"images/artists/dungeoneering.webp","bio":"東京のプロデューサー Albino Sound と、D.A.N. の Daigos によるライブユニット。2025年に結成され、岩壁音楽祭や Rainbow Disco Club でライブを行ってきた。","bio_en":"A live duo of Tokyo producer Albino Sound and Daigos of the band D.A.N. Formed in 2025, they have already played Gampeki Music Festival and Rainbow Disco Club.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/dungeoneering__/","bandcamp":"https://dungeon-eering.bandcamp.com/album/where-2-ep"}},{"id":"feline","name":"Feline","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HOUSE","image":"images/artists/feline.webp","bio":"東京を拠点とするDJ。1995年に茨城県で生まれ、10代のころ地元の水戸でDJを始めた。2010年代のベースミュージックから影響を受けつつ、そこに留まらないミックスを続ける。2025年からはclub asiaの「clubasia THURSDAY」で奇数月第1木曜のキュレーションを担当。渋谷のDJ Bar Bridgeでは、HIROSHI KAWANABEとのパーティーを毎月開いている。","bio_en":"Tokyo-based FELINE was born in Ibaraki in 1995 and started DJing as a teenager in hometown Mito. UK bass music and leftfield from the 2010s left a mark, but the sets don't stay inside those lines. Since 2025 FELINE has curated clubasia THURSDAY on the first Thursday of odd months, and shares a monthly night with Hiroshi Kawanabe at DJ Bar Bridge in Shibuya.","name_en":"Feline","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/feline__l/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/felinefeline"}},{"id":"floating-points","name":"Floating Points","city":"LONDON","country":"UK","genre":"HOUSE","image":"images/artists/floating-points.webp","bio":"本名 Sam Shepherd。マンチェスターで育ち、ロンドン大学（UCL）で神経科学の博士号を取得した。2008年に Alexander Nut とレーベル Eglo を立ち上げ、2015年に自身のレーベル Pluto を設立。同年の1stアルバム『Elaenia』に続き、2021年には Pharoah Sanders、ロンドン交響楽団との『Promises』を発表した。2024年に『Cascade』をリリース。","bio_en":"Sam Shepherd grew up in Manchester and earned a PhD in neuroscience at UCL. Shepherd co-founded Eglo Records with Alexander Nut in 2008 and set up the Pluto label in 2015, the year the debut Floating Points album \"Elaenia\" came out. \"Promises\", made with Pharoah Sanders and the London Symphony Orchestra, followed in 2021, and \"Cascade\" in 2024.","name_en":"Floating Points","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/floatingpoints","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/floatingpoints","bandcamp":"https://floatingpoints.bandcamp.com/","website":"http://www.floatingpoints.co.uk"}},{"id":"gerd-janson","name":"Gerd Janson","city":"FRANKFURT","country":"GERMANY","genre":"HOUSE/DISCO","image":"images/artists/gerd-janson.webp","bio":"フランクフルトを拠点とするDJ。2002年に Thorsten Scheu（Glance）とレーベル Running Back を立ち上げ、ハウスとディスコを軸にリリースを重ねてきた。1998年にダルムシュタットの Café Kesselhaus で初のレジデントを得て、のちにフランクフルトの Robert Johnson で Thomas Hammann とパーティー Liquid を主宰。Groove や Spex に寄稿する音楽ライターでもあった。","bio_en":"Frankfurt-based DJ Gerd Janson co-founded Running Back with Thorsten Scheu (Glance) in 2002, and the label has stayed rooted in house and disco ever since. His first residency came in 1998 at Café Kesselhaus in Darmstadt; later he hosted the Liquid nights at Frankfurt's Robert Johnson alongside Thomas Hammann. Away from the booth, he wrote about music for Groove and Spex.","name_en":"Gerd Janson","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/gerdjansonofficial","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/runningback","bandcamp":"https://runningbackrecords.bandcamp.com"}},{"id":"gonno","name":"Gonno","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO/ HOUSE","image":"images/artists/gonno.webp","imagePosition":"center","bio":"ジャパニーズ・ハウス/テクノシーンを代表するDJ/プロデューサーとして国内外で活躍。これまでにInternational Feel Recordings (Ibiza)、Beats In Space(New York), Ostgut-Ton(Berlin)など海外のレーベルを中心に数々の作品を発表。2015年にリリースされた2ndアルバム”Remember The Life Is Beautiful”はPitchforkやResident Advisor等の海外メディアでも紹介され、日本のMusic Magazine紙に年間ベストディスクにもランクインされた。またドラマー/パーカッショニスト増村和彦とGonno x Masumura名義でライブ活動も行っており、アルバム”In Circles”ではアシッディかつメロディックなシンセサイザーとアフロ・ビートを通過したライヴドラムの実験性の高いコラボレーションを発表し各方面の話題となった。","bio_en":"A DJ/producer at the forefront of the Japanese house/techno scene, active both at home and abroad. He has released a string of works primarily on overseas labels including International Feel Recordings (Ibiza), Beats In Space (New York) and Ostgut-Ton (Berlin). His second album, \"Remember The Life Is Beautiful,\" released in 2015, drew coverage from international outlets such as Pitchfork and Resident Advisor, and placed among the year's best albums in Japan's Music Magazine. He also performs live alongside drummer/percussionist Kazuhiko Masumura as Gonno x Masumura; their album \"In Circles\" — a highly experimental collaboration pairing acid-tinged, melodic synthesizers with live drumming filtered through Afrobeat — became a talking point across the board.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/djgonno/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/gonno","bandcamp":"https://gonno.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"haai","name":"HAAi","city":"LONDON","country":"UK","genre":"HOUSE","image":"images/artists/haai.webp","bio":"西オーストラリア出身、ロンドンを拠点とするプロデューサー/DJ。本名は Teneil Throssell。シンガーソングライターとして活動を始め、ロンドンではブリクストンのクラブ Phonox でレジデントを務めた。Mute から2022年にデビューアルバム『Baby, We're Ascending』、2025年に『HUMANiSE』を発表。2023年には !K7 のミックスシリーズ DJ-Kicks を手がけている。","bio_en":"HAAi is Teneil Throssell, a producer and DJ from Western Australia now based in London. She started out as a singer-songwriter, and in London held a residency at Phonox in Brixton. Her debut album \"Baby, We're Ascending\" came out on Mute in 2022, followed by \"HUMANiSE\" on the same label in 2025. In 2023 she mixed an instalment of !K7's DJ-Kicks series.","name_en":"HAAi","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/haaihaaihaai","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/haai-2","bandcamp":"https://haai.bandcamp.com","website":"https://mute.com/?p=220"}},{"id":"helena-hauff","name":"Helena Hauff","city":"HAMBURG","country":"GERMANY","genre":"TECHNO/ELECTRONIC/LIVE","image":"images/artists/helena-hauff.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"ハンブルクを拠点とするDJ/プロデューサー。テクノ、エレクトロ、アシッドを横断し、ハードウェアでトラックを組み立てる。2015年に Werkdiscs からデビューアルバム『Discreet Desires』、2018年に Ninja Tune から『Qualm』を発表。2015年には自身のレーベル Return To Disorder を立ち上げている。","bio_en":"Hamburg DJ and producer Helena Hauff moves across techno, electro and acid, building tracks on hardware. The debut album \"Discreet Desires\" came out on Werkdiscs in 2015, followed by \"Qualm\" on Ninja Tune in 2018. 2015 also saw the launch of Helena Hauff's own label, Return To Disorder.","name_en":"Helena Hauff","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/helena_hauff_fanpage/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/helena-hauff","bandcamp":"https://helenahauff.bandcamp.com"}},{"id":"jonathan-kusuma","name":"Jonathan Kusuma","city":"JAKARTA","country":"INDONESIA","genre":"HOUSE","image":"images/artists/jonathan-kusuma.webp","bio":"ジャカルタ出身のミュージシャン/プロデューサー/DJ。仲間2人と始めたコレクティブ兼レーベル Dekadenz を軸に、地元でパーティーを続ける。2014年に I'm a Cliché からデビュー EP『Gong 3000』、2016年に Cocktail d'Amore から『Black Magic EP』を発表。それ以前は Space.rec（2009〜2015）や、Komodo と運営した Akamady Records にも関わった。","bio_en":"Jonathan Kusuma is a musician, producer and DJ from Jakarta, where Dekadenz, the collective, label and party he started with two friends, keeps him rooted. His debut EP \"Gong 3000\" came out on I'm a Cliché in 2014, and the \"Black Magic EP\" followed on Cocktail d'Amore in 2016. Before Dekadenz he was involved with the local labels Space.rec (2009 to 2015) and Akamady Records, the latter with Gerhan Ferdinal, aka Komodo.","name_en":"Jonathan Kusuma","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/ojonkusuma/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/jonathan-kusuma","bandcamp":"https://jonathankusumamusic.bandcamp.com"}},{"id":"jonny-rock","name":"Jonny Rock","city":"LONDON","country":"UK","genre":"HOUSE/DISCO","image":"images/artists/jonny-rock.webp","bio":"ロンドンのハウス/ディスコのシーンで活動するDJ/プロデューサー。2000年代にはレコード店 Phonica と Blackmarket Records のカウンターに立ち、Luke Solomon のプロジェクト Freaks ではギターを弾いた。Make Love in Public Spaces や Playhouse などからリリースがある。シカゴハウス、ディスコ、ブギーをつなぐセットに、トルコのサイケデリックな音源を混ぜることもある。","bio_en":"Jonny Rock is a London DJ and producer from the city's house and disco scene. In the 2000s he worked behind the counter at Phonica and Blackmarket Records, and he played guitar in Luke Solomon's Freaks project. Releases include Make Love in Public Spaces, Cabin Fever, Wolf + Lamb Black, Playhouse and Music for Freaks. His sets link old school Chicago house, underground disco and boogie, sometimes with Turkish psychedelic records dug up in Istanbul and Izmir.","name_en":"Jonny Rock","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/captainrocklock/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/jonnyrock","bandcamp":"https://gottwax.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"kikiorix","name":"Kikiorix","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HOUSE/DISCO","image":"images/artists/kikiorix.webp","bio":"日本・東京を拠点に活動。Kikiorixは日本国内はもちろん、海外でも数多くのクラブやフェスティバルでプレイしてきた。Rush Hour x RDCによるSomewhere in Amsterdam、Dusk Camp Los Angeles、Fabric London、The End/Aka London、Space Ibiza、Tresor Berlinなど、ヨーロッパにとどまらず、ハワイ、中国、タイ、スリランカなどにも招かれている。2000年代にはロンドンを拠点とし、Tomoki Tamuraとともにレジデントを務めたHolicで多くのDJ経験を積み、その後Tresvibesの一員として日本最大級の音楽フェスティバルのひとつであるFuji Rock Festivalへの出演も果たした。平日はRealrockdesignにてデザイナーとして多忙な日々を送る。Rainbow Disco Clubのレジデントデザイナー兼DJ。","bio_en":"Based in Tokyo, Japan.Kikiorix has played in many clubs and festivals in Japan as well as abroad including Somewhere in Amsterdam by Rush Hour x RDC, Dusk Camp Los Angeles, Fabric London, The End/Aka London, Space Ibiza, Tresor Berlin – and not only Europe but also he was invited to Hawaii, China, Thailand, Sri Lanka etc. Being based in London in 00s, he gained a lot of DJ experiences as a Holic resident together with Tomoki Tamura, and later he got to perform at one of the biggest music festivals in Japan, Fuji Rock Festival as a member of Tresvibes. During weekdays, he is busy working as a designer at Realrockdesign. A resident DJ and designer for Rainbow Disco Club.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/kikigraphix/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/kikiorix"}},{"id":"mala","name":"Mala","city":"LONDON","country":"UK","genre":"DUBSTEP","image":"images/artists/mala.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"本名 Mark Lawrence。ロンドン南部サウス・ノーウッド育ちのプロデューサー/DJ。Coki とのデュオ Digital Mystikz、そして DMZ の創設メンバーとして、まだ名前のなかったダブステップを形づくった。2006年にレーベル DEEP MEDi MUSIK を設立し、2012年には『Mala in Cuba』を発表。2006年の「Anti War Dub」は、2025年に RA の今世紀の名曲投票で2位に選ばれた。","bio_en":"Mark Lawrence, raised in South Norwood, South London, helped shape dubstep before it had a name, as one half of Digital Mystikz with Coki and a founding member of DMZ. He set up DEEP MEDi MUSIK in 2006 and released \"Mala in Cuba\" in 2012. In 2025 his 2006 track \"Anti War Dub\" came second in RA's Favourite Music of the Century poll.","name_en":"Mala","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/maladmz","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/maladmz","website":"http://www.maladmz.com"}},{"id":"nc4k","name":"NC4K","city":"KYOTO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HOUSE","image":"images/artists/nc4k.webp","bio":"京都のダンスミュージック・レーベル NC4K（No Collar 4 Kicks）を動かす Stones Taro と Lomax のB2B。レーベルは2017年に始まり、2026年5月時点でデジタルを含め40以上のタイトルを出している。Stones Taro は Rinse FM のマンスリー・レジデントで、Scuffed Recordings などからも作品を発表。Lomax はレーベルの本拠、京都 West Harlem の現場を支える。","bio_en":"The B2B of Stones Taro and Lomax, the pair behind the Kyoto dance music label NC4K (No Collar 4 Kicks). Started in 2017, the label had more than 40 titles out, digital included, by May 2026. Stones Taro holds a monthly residency on Rinse FM and has released on Scuffed Recordings among others; Lomax keeps the floor at West Harlem, the Kyoto club NC4K calls home.","links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/nc4k","website":"https://nc4k.xyz/"}},{"id":"ouissam","name":"Ouissam","city":"HANOI","country":"INDONESIA","genre":"HOUSE/DISCO","image":"images/artists/ouissam.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"アジアを拠点に10年以上活動する DJ。香港でレーベル Cliché Records を設立し、ディスコ、ハウス、テクノを混ぜて掛けるスタイルを同地でいち早く広めた。その後 Homesick と Fragrant Harbour の2レーベルを立ち上げ、ベトナム・ハノイではクラブ Savage を作って月例のクィア・パーティー Snug を主宰する。フェスティバル Equation のキュレーションも手がける。","bio_en":"A DJ who has spent more than a decade working across Asia. Ouissam founded Cliché Records in Hong Kong, one of the first in the city to push a mix of disco, house and techno, then started the Homesick and Fragrant Harbour labels. In Hanoi he set up the club Savage, where he runs the monthly queer night Snug, and he also curates the Equation festival.","name_en":"Ouissam","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/ouissam.jpeg/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/ouissamhk"}},{"id":"yamarchy","name":"Yamarchy","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HOUSE/DISCO","image":"images/artists/yamarchy.webp","bio":"東京を拠点とするDJ。2019年に渋谷・道玄坂のMitsukiが開店して以来、レジデントDJ兼ディレクターとしてブッキングを担う。コズミックやバレアリックを軸に、アンダーグラウンドの埋もれたレコードを掘り起こす。江ノ島OPPA-LA、青山ZERO、八王子SHeLTeRで自身のパーティーを主宰。ベルリンのPanorama Bar、ニューヨークのNowadays、札幌PRECIOUS HALL、タイのWonderfruitにも出演している。","bio_en":"Tokyo DJ Yamarchy has been resident, director and booker at Mitsuki, the basement club in Shibuya's Dogenzaka, since it opened in 2019. The records lean cosmic and Balearic, dug from the obscure end of the underground. Yamarchy runs parties at OPPA-LA in Enoshima, ZERO in Aoyama and SHeLTeR in Hachioji, and has played Panorama Bar in Berlin, Nowadays in New York and Precious Hall in Sapporo, as well as Wonderfruit in Thailand.","name_en":"Yamarchy","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/yamarchy/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/yamarchy-ymd"}},{"id":"suze-ijo","name":"Suze Ijó","city":"ROTTERDAM","country":"NETHERLANDS","genre":"HOUSE","image":"images/artists/suze-ijo.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"ロッテルダム出身の DJ。David Mancuso の Loft パーティーに影響を受けた地元のコミュニティ First Floor に加わり、レコード収集に本腰を入れた。セットではシカゴ・ハウスや80年代の曲、ソウルフルなグルーヴを掛ける。Panorama Bar、De School、Nowadays などでプレイし、Dekmantel Festival では Connects Stage のキュレーションも手がけた。","bio_en":"A Rotterdam-born DJ whose record collecting stepped up when she joined First Floor, a now-closed community space in her home city modelled on David Mancuso's Loft parties. That Loft ethos runs through sets of Chicago house, uplifting 80s cuts and warm soulful grooves. She has played Panorama Bar, De School and Nowadays, and curated the Connects Stage at Dekmantel Festival.","name_en":"Suze Ijó","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/suze.ijo","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/suze_ijo"}},{"id":"four-tet","name":"Four Tet","city":"LONDON","country":"UK","genre":"HOUSE","image":"images/artists/four-tet.webp","bio":"本名 Kieran Hebden。ロンドンのプロデューサー/DJ。ポストロック・バンド Fridge を経て、1998年に36分の単曲「Thirtysixtwentyfive」で Four Tet 名義の活動を始めた。『Pause』（2001）、『Rounds』（2003）、『There Is Love in You』（2010）などのアルバムで知られ、Steve Reid との即興作品や Burial、Thom Yorke との共作もある。","bio_en":"Four Tet is London producer and DJ Kieran Hebden. After the post-rock band Fridge, he started the project in 1998 with the 36-minute single \"Thirtysixtwentyfive\". Albums like \"Pause\" (2001), \"Rounds\" (2003) and \"There Is Love in You\" (2010) built his name, alongside improvised records with drummer Steve Reid and collaborations with Burial and Thom Yorke.","name_en":"Four Tet","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/fourtetkieran","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/four-tet","bandcamp":"https://fourtet.bandcamp.com/","website":"https://www.fourtet.net/"}},{"id":"eric-cloutier","name":"Eric Cloutier","city":"BERLIN","country":"GERMANY","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/eric-cloutier.webp","bio":"デトロイト出身、ベルリンを拠点とするDJ。ニューヨークのパーティー The Bunker で長く腕を磨いたのちベルリンへ移り、現在は Tresor のレジデントを務める。キャリアは25年を超え、深く催眠的でダブの効いた質感を探してレコードを掘り続けてきた。レーベル Palinoia を主宰し、自作のほか新しい作り手の作品も送り出している。","bio_en":"Detroit-born, Berlin-based DJ Eric Cloutier spent years as a mainstay of New York's The Bunker before moving to Berlin, where he is now a resident at Tresor. Over a 25-plus year career he has kept digging for deep, hypnotic, dubby records. His label Palinoia releases his own productions alongside music from newer names.","name_en":"Eric Cloutier","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/ericcloutier","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/cloutier","bandcamp":"https://palinoiarecords.bandcamp.com/","website":"http://www.eric-cloutier.com/"}},{"id":"fuji","name":"FUJI","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/fuji.webp","bio":"本名 Naoki Fujii。キャンプイン型の野外フェス MATRICARIA と、パーティー LAB. のレジデントDJ/オーガナイザー。ディープテクノとアンビエントテクノを軸に、音の層を少しずつ重ねる丁寧なミックスでセットを組む。DJとしてだけでなく、時間や空間、人の流れまで含めてパーティー全体の体験を組み立てることを目指している。","bio_en":"FUJI (real name Naoki Fujii) is a resident DJ and organizer for MATRICARIA, a camp-in open-air festival, and the party LAB. Working from deep techno and ambient techno, FUJI builds sets with careful mixing that adds layers of sound bit by bit. Beyond DJing, the aim is to shape the whole party experience, down to time, space and the way people move through it.","name_en":"FUJI","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/naoki__fujii/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/naokifujii"}},{"id":"prins-thomas","name":"Prins Thomas","city":"OSLO","country":"NORWAY","genre":"HOUSE/DISCO","image":"images/artists/prins-thomas.webp","imagePosition":"center","bio":"本名 Thomas Moen Hermansen。ノルウェーのスペースディスコを担ってきたDJ/プロデューサー/リミキサー。ブレイクダンスの延長でヒップホップやエレクトロを掛け始め、その後はベーシストとして多くのバンドで演奏した。2003年からは Lindstrøm と組んで制作を重ねる。ノルウェーの才能に絞ったレーベル Full Pupp を主宰し、サブレーベル Internasjonal なども動かしている。","bio_en":"Thomas Moen Hermansen is a DJ, producer and remixer at the heart of Norwegian space disco. He started mixing hip hop and electro as an extension of breakdancing, then went on to play bass in a long run of bands. He has worked with Lindstrøm since 2003, and runs Full Pupp, a label devoted to Norwegian talent, alongside sublabels including Internasjonal.","name_en":"Prins Thomas","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/prinsthomas","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/prinsthomas","bandcamp":"https://prinsthomas.bandcamp.com/music"}},{"id":"rami","name":"RAMI","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HOUSE/DISCO","image":"images/artists/rami.webp","bio":"東京を拠点とするDJ。福島出身、2002年生まれ。渋谷に根づくバレアリック、ニューディスコ、ディスコダブに影響を受け、2023年にレコードのみのDJとして活動を始めた。自身のパーティー「lorca」を不定期に開くほか、青山TUNNELではDNGとともに2年間レギュラーを務めた。","bio_en":"Tokyo-based DJ, born in 2002 and originally from Fukushima. Shibuya's long-running Balearic, nu disco and disco dub scene set the direction, and RAMI started out in 2023 playing vinyl only. RAMI throws an irregular party called lorca and spent two years as a regular at Aoyama TUNNEL alongside DNG.","name_en":"RAMI","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/rami.6s/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/user-76845170"}},{"id":"pianeti-sintetici","name":"Pianeti Sintetici","city":"MILAN","country":"ITALY","genre":"TECHNO/AMBIENT/EXPERIMENTAL","image":"images/artists/pianeti-sintetici.webp","bio":"ミラノの Davide Perrone（Primal Code）によるソロ・プロジェクト。2020年に始動し、アンビエント、テクノ、実験的な電子音楽を行き来する。名前は『銀河ヒッチハイク・ガイド』の、世界が注文生産される惑星マグラテアから来ている。アナログシンセとモジュラーによる長い即興を、編集とサウンドデザインで仕上げる。Hypnus Records、Astral Industries、Samurai Music から作品を出している。","bio_en":"The solo project of Milan producer Davide Perrone (Primal Code), running since 2020 across ambient, techno and experimental electronics. The name comes from Magrathea, the planet in \"The Hitchhiker's Guide to the Galaxy\" where whole worlds are built to order. Long improvisations on analogue synths and modular systems are edited into shape, with releases on Hypnus Records, Astral Industries and Samurai Music.","name_en":"Pianeti Sintetici","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/pianetisintetici","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/pianetisintetici","bandcamp":"https://pianetisintetici.bandcamp.com/","website":"https://ghost-collective.com/pianeti-sintetici"}},{"id":"ground","name":"Ground","city":"OSAKA","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HOUSE","image":"images/artists/ground.webp","bio":"大阪を拠点とするDJ / プロデューサー。レーベル Chill Mountain Rec の General Producer。音楽スタイルの土台にあるのは、2005年から大阪の山間部でレギュラー開催されてきた野外パーティ「Chill Mountain」。その後、サウンドエンジニアのKabamix、デザイナーのMt.chillsとともにレーベル Chill Mountain Rec を立ち上げ、様々な才能を発掘しリリースを重ねてきた。ジャンルを超えたユニークなサウンドを追求し、ダンスフロアのための新しいクリエイションを生み出し続けている。\n\n活動の場はヨーロッパ、南米、北米、アジアへと広がり、これまでに29カ国以上のフェスティバル / イベントに出演。近年はタイのWonderfruit FestivalのPolygonステージに3年連続で出演している。2018年にはLAの ESP Institute からアルバム『SUNIZM』、カナダの Multi Culti からEP『Syuiro Seki (朱色の石)』をリリース。世界各地のプロデューサーとのコラボレーション作品も多く、ドキュメンタリーフィルム『倭文 (しずり) 旅するカジの木』への楽曲提供も手がける。2025年、ESP Institute よりアルバム『Yaoyorozoo』を発表。","bio_en":"Osaka-based DJ and producer, and General Producer of the label Chill Mountain Rec.\nThe foundation of his sound is \"Chill Mountain,\" the open-air party held regularly in the mountains outside Osaka since 2005. He went on to found Chill Mountain Rec with sound engineer Kabamix and designer Mt.chills, digging out and releasing new talent. His music moves across genres, always aimed at creating something new for the dancefloor.\n\nHe has performed at festivals and events in more than 29 countries across Europe, South America, North America and Asia. In recent years he has played the Polygon stage at Wonderfruit Festival in Thailand for three consecutive years.In 2018 he released the album SUNIZM on ESP Institute in Los Angeles, followed by the EP Syuiro Seki on Canada's Multi Culti, alongside numerous collaborations with producers worldwide. He has also composed for the documentary film Shizuri: Tabi suru Kaji no Ki. In 2025 he released the album Yaoyorozoo on ESP Institute.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/mtchill_ground/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/dj-ground","bandcamp":"https://chillmountain1.bandcamp.com/","website":"https://linktr.ee/Ground_jp"}},{"id":"akie","name":"Akie","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO/HOUSE/MINIMAL/EXPERIMENTAL","image":"images/artists/akie.webp","bio":"東京を拠点とするDJ、レコードバイヤー。大阪の中古レコード店 raregroove で約2年働いたのち、2018年に同じ大阪の newtone records に入り、レコードバイヤーを務めている。DJ活動は関西で始め、のちに東京へ拠点を移した。バイヤーとしてもDJとしても、扱う音楽はオールジャンル。2022年にはブリストルのレーベル do you have peace? からミックステープを発表した。","bio_en":"A Tokyo-based DJ and record buyer. After about two years at the Osaka used-record shop raregroove, Akie joined newtone records, also in Osaka, as a buyer in 2018. The DJing started in Kansai before the move to Tokyo, and in both roles the remit is all genres. In 2022 the Bristol label do you have peace? released an Akie mixtape.","name_en":"AKIE","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/04_1404_14/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/ak_is_error"}},{"id":"adhemar","name":"AdhéMar","city":"PARIS","country":"FRANCE","genre":"TECHNO/AMBIENT","image":"images/artists/adhemar.webp","bio":"パリを拠点に、音楽とビジュアルの両面で活動するフランスのアーティスト。プロデュースでもDJでもトランジションの細部にこだわり、音が持つ「光」の質感を主題に置く。済州島のレーベルOslatedから『Mountain View』を発表し、同レーベルのデザインも手がける。2026年6月には、ソウルで開かれたOslatedの10周年ショーケースにヘッドライナーとして出演した。","bio_en":"Paris-based French artist working across music and visual art. Whether producing or DJing, he puts the weight on transitions and on what he calls the luminous quality of sound. He released Mountain View on Oslated, a label from Jeju Island in Korea where he also handles the design, and headlined its tenth anniversary showcase in Seoul in June 2026.","name_en":"AdhéMar","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/adhemar_music/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/adhemarmusic","bandcamp":"https://adhemar.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"allen-mock","name":"Allen Mock","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"BASS/DUBSTEP","image":"images/artists/allen-mock.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"東京のプロデューサー／DJ。ダブステップやトラップなどベース・ミュージックを軸にする。名前は家族が営む店「Arenmoku」にちなむ。2017年のデビュー曲「Don't」がBeatportのFuture Bass/Trapチャートで3位に入り、2018年にはHybrid Trapから「Suna」を発表。EDC Japanに出演し、2022年にはULTRA JAPANでもプレイした。","bio_en":"Tokyo producer and DJ rooted in bass music, from dubstep to trap. The name comes from Arenmoku, his family's restaurant. His 2017 debut single \"Don't\" reached No. 3 on Beatport's Future Bass/Trap chart, and \"Suna\" followed on Hybrid Trap in 2018. He has played EDC Japan and, in 2022, Ultra Japan.","name_en":"Allen Mock","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/allenmockmusic/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/allenmock","bandcamp":"https://allenmock.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"doltz","name":"Doltz.","city":"FUKUOKA","country":"JAPAN","genre":"LIVE/TECHNO/AMBIENT","image":"images/artists/doltz.webp","bio":"サウンドアーティスト／DJ。Omega Point と、DJ Nobu が主宰する Bitta に関わる。ノルウェーの Monument や東京の WOMB でプレイしてきた。シンセサイザーを使った制作とドローイングも手がける。","bio_en":"A sound artist and DJ involved with Omega Point and with Bitta, the outfit run by DJ Nobu. Doltz has played Monument in Norway and WOMB in Tokyo, and also works with synthesizers and drawing.","name_en":"Doltz.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/doltzdeep/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/doltzdeep","bandcamp":"https://doltzdeep.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"joma","name":"Joma","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO/HOUSE","image":"images/artists/joma.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"東京のDJ。中目黒Solfaで開かれるテクノ／ハウスのパーティー「Night Trip」を活動の軸とし、各回のラインナップに名を連ねる。同パーティーは2026年10月の回にJohn PlazaとStefan Goldmannを招いた。リスニング・パーティー「Day Trip」にも関わり、アパレルも手がける。","bio_en":"Tokyo DJ whose home base is Night Trip, a techno and house party held at Solfa in Nakameguro, where Joma turns up on every lineup. The October 2026 edition brought in John Plaza and Stefan Goldmann. Joma is also involved with the listening party Day Trip and has an apparel line.","name_en":"Joma","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/jomajjj/"}},{"id":"suguru-mochizuki","name":"Suguru Mochizuki","city":"YAMANASHI","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO/HOUSE","image":"images/artists/suguru-mochizuki.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"山梨・甲府を拠点とするDJ。2012年にDJを始め、テクノ、テックハウス、プログレッシブ・ハウスを軸にミックスする。2015年に地元山梨でテクノ・パーティー「SOL.」を立ち上げ、2022年からは甲府のDJバー「ofi」を運営している。","bio_en":"Kofu-based DJ who started playing in 2012, working mostly with techno, tech house and progressive house. Back home in Yamanashi, Suguru Mochizuki launched the techno party SOL. in 2015, and since 2022 has run ofi, a small DJ bar in Kofu.","name_en":"Suguru Mochizuki","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/sgrmczk_ofi/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/suguru-mochiduki"}},{"id":"yukimasa","name":"YUKIMASA","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/yukimasa.webp","bio":"東京を拠点とする DJ／プロデューサー。90年代後半にカリフォルニア州アナハイムで活動を始め、2000年代初めに帰国した。2007年から東京のクラブで自身のパーティー「FORCE」を続けている。2019年にはイタリアのアーティスト Drafted とともに、日本とイタリアを拠点とするレーベル Paradigma Records を立ち上げた。","bio_en":"A Tokyo-based DJ and producer who started out in Anaheim, California in the late 90s before moving back to Japan in the early 2000s. He has run his own party, FORCE, across Tokyo clubs since 2007, and in 2019 launched Paradigma Records, a label split between Japan and Italy, with Italian artist Drafted.","name_en":"YUKIMASA","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/norihiro_yukimasa","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/djyukimasa","bandcamp":"https://paradigmarecords.bandcamp.com"}},{"id":"tonbo","name":"Tonbo","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"LIVE","image":"images/artists/tonbo.webp","bio":"東京を拠点とするライブ・アーティスト。モジュラーシンセにインドの竹笛バンスリと自らの声を組み合わせ、テクノ、ハウス、ダウンテンポ、アンビエントを横断する即興のライブを行う。会場や時間帯に合わせてセットを変える。2025年にNory Kimijimaとレーベル「ppq rec」を設立。2026年1月にはメキシコ・トゥルムのDay Zeroに、日本人として初めて出演した。","bio_en":"Tokyo live act working with modular synths, the bansuri (an Indian bamboo flute) and his own voice. The sets are improvised, drifting between techno, house, downtempo and ambient depending on the room and the hour. In 2025 he co-founded the label ppq rec with Nory Kimijima, and in January 2026 he became the first Japanese artist to play Day Zero in Tulum, Mexico.","name_en":"Tonbo","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/tonboq","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/djtonbo","bandcamp":"https://tonbo.bandcamp.com/","website":"https://tonbo.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"sunga","name":"SUNGA","city":"KANAGAWA","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HOUSE","image":"images/artists/sunga.webp","bio":"EEZEE、COREHEAD、BEACH WHISTLE、BLACKSHEEP といったパーティーやクルーに関わるDJ。\n都内を中心に全国さまざまな箱でプレイ。野外パーティでのDJプレイにも定評がある。\nレコード店やイベントとの結びつきも深く、現場の数を積み上げることで立ち位置をつくってきたタイプである。","bio_en":"A DJ involved with parties and crews including EEZEE, COREHEAD, BEACH WHISTLE and BLACKSHEEP.\nPlaying mainly in Tokyo but also at venues across the country, with a solid reputation for his sets at open-air parties as well.\nHe also maintains close ties with record shops and events — the type who has carved out his position by stacking up sheer numbers of appearances on the floor.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/sunga_eezee/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/sunga","bandcamp":"https://eeezeee.bandcamp.com/","website":"https://linktr.ee/SUNGA_EEZEE"}},{"id":"dj-yazi","name":"DJ Yazi","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/dj-yazi.webp","imagePosition":"center","bio":"90年代半ばから活動する東京のDJ。前衛的なヒップホップ集団Think Tankの一員として、Black Smoker Recordsと歩んできた。パーティーEl Ninoのレジデントを20年務める。Harukaとのユニット Twin Peaksでは、ライヴとDJの境界を溶かした即興を聴かせる。スタイルを横断しながら、深く沈んだグルーヴという一本の芯は動かない。","bio_en":"A Tokyo DJ active since the mid-90s, part of the avant-garde hip hop collective Think Tank and its label Black Smoker Records. DJ Yazi has held a residency at the party El Nino for two decades, and as Twin Peaks with Haruka improvises across the line between live and DJ sets. The styles move freely, but the deep, tripped-out groove at the centre never does.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/dj_yazi_bsr/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/svozupq7gv6f"}},{"id":"iron","name":"Iron","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO/HOUSE","image":"images/artists/iron.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"東京を拠点とするテクノDJ。南青山 VENT のパーティー SAMSARA でレジデントを務め、Peter Van Hoesen、Eric Cloutier、Polar Inertia ら海外からのゲストと共演してきた。インドと韓国でもツアーを行い、2026年1月にはソウルの vurt. で開かれた VANTA × SAMSARA に出演している。","bio_en":"Tokyo techno DJ Iron holds a residency at SAMSARA, the party at VENT, where he has shared the bill with international guests including Peter Van Hoesen, Eric Cloutier and Polar Inertia. He has toured India and South Korea, and in January 2026 played VANTA × SAMSARA at vurt. in Seoul.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/iron_eisaku/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/eisaku-ihashi"}},{"id":"kiko-dinucci","name":"Kiko Dinucci","country":"BRAZIL","genre":"LIVE","image":"images/artists/kiko-dinucci.webp","imagePosition":"center","bio":"サンパウロのギタリストであり作曲家。Metá Metá と Passo Torto の創設メンバーである。Elza Soares、Tom Zé、Criolo、Jards Macalé、Marcelo D2 と共演してきた。若い頃のパンクやハードコア、そしてサンバ。どちらにも完全には属さないと本人は語る。激しいアコースティックギターに女性コーラスが応える構図が、その音の核にある。","bio_en":"A guitarist and composer from São Paulo, and a founding member of both Metá Metá and Passo Torto. He has performed alongside Elza Soares, Tom Zé, Criolo, Jards Macalé and Marcelo D2. Punk and hardcore in his youth, and samba — he says he belongs fully to neither. At the core of his sound is a structure in which ferocious acoustic guitar is answered by a female chorus.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/KikoDinucci/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/kikodinucci","bandcamp":"https://kikodinucci.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"the-master-musicians-of-joujouka","name":"The Master Musicians of Joujouka","country":"MOROCCO","genre":"LIVE","image":"images/artists/the-master-musicians-of-joujouka.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"モロッコ北部リーフ山地、ジャジューカ村のスーフィー・トランス楽団。1950年代初頭から続き、村の50人を超える音楽家が名を連ねる。1971年、Brian Jones が録音した LP がローリング・ストーンズのレーベルから出た。それを機に、村の音楽は世界に知られることになる。2021年にはポンピドゥー・センターでのライヴ盤を発表している。","bio_en":"A collective of Jbala Sufi trance musicians from the village of Joujouka in Morocco's Rif mountains, performing since the early 1950s and numbering over fifty musicians. In 1971 an LP recorded by Brian Jones was released on Rolling Stones Records, carrying the village's music to the world. A live album recorded at Centre Pompidou followed in 2021.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/mastermusiciansofjoujouka/","bandcamp":"https://zehra.bandcamp.com/","website":"https://www.joujouka.org/"}},{"id":"kuo-from-sunset-rollercoaster","name":"Kuo From Sunset Rollercoaster","city":"TAIPEI","country":"TAIWAN","genre":"BAND","image":"images/artists/kuo-from-sunset-rollercoaster.webp","bio":"台北のバンド落日飛車（Sunset Rollercoaster）で作曲、ボーカル、ギターを担う曾國宏（Kuo）。台北のライブハウス「地下社会」周辺の実験的なバンドを経て、2016年のEP『Jinji Kikko』でバンドをAORやシンセ・ファンクへ転換させた。2020年の『SOFT STORM』は台湾の金曲奨で最優秀バンド賞を受賞。2024年には韓国のHYUKOHとの共作『AAA』を発表した。","bio_en":"Tseng Kuo-hung, known as Kuo, writes, sings and plays guitar in the Taipei band Sunset Rollercoaster. After years in experimental projects around Taipei's Underworld venue, the 2016 EP \"Jinji Kikko\" swung the band toward AOR and synth funk. \"SOFT STORM\" (2020) won Best Band at Taiwan's Golden Melody Awards, and \"AAA\" (2024) was made in full with Korea's HYUKOH.","name_en":"Kuo From Sunset Rollercoaster","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/sunsetrollercoaster/","website":"https://festivaldefrue.com/music/kuo-from-sunset-rollercoaster.html"}},{"id":"sylvan-esso","name":"Sylvan Esso","country":"USA","genre":"LIVE","image":"images/artists/sylvan-esso.webp","bio":"Amelia Meath と Nick Sanborn によるエレクトロニック・ポップ・デュオ。\nノースカロライナ州ダーラムを拠点に4作のアルバムを発表し、グラミー賞に2度ノミネートされている。","bio_en":"An electronic pop duo of Amelia Meath and Nick Sanborn based in Durham, North Carolina, with four albums and two Grammy nominations.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/sylvanesso/","bandcamp":"https://sylvanesso.bandcamp.com/","website":"https://www.sylvanesso.com/"}},{"id":"acid-pauli","name":"Acid Pauli","city":"BERLIN","country":"GERMANY","genre":"HOUSE/TECHNO","image":"images/artists/acid-pauli.webp","bio":"ベルリンを拠点とする Martin Gretschmann のソロ名義。Nico Stojan と共にレーベル Ouïe を主宰し、テクノやハウスを軸に、サイケデリックで実験的な独自のダンスミュージックで知られる。","bio_en":"The solo alias of Berlin-based Martin Gretschmann. He co-runs the label Ouïe with Nico Stojan and is known for a distinctive strain of dance music—rooted in techno and house, yet psychedelic and experimental.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/therealacidpauli","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/acidpauli"}},{"id":"alabaster-deplume","name":"Alabaster DePlume","country":"UK","genre":"LIVE","image":"images/artists/alabaster-deplume.webp","bio":"サックス奏者であり、詩人。シカゴのレーベル International Anthem から作品を発表している。『GOLD』（2022）、『Salty Road Dogs Victory Anthem』（2023）、『Come With Fierce Grace』（2023）と、短い間隔で作品を重ねてきた。ジャズと語りの境界を漂う表現は、他の誰にも似ていない。","bio_en":"A saxophonist and poet releasing on Chicago's International Anthem, with \"GOLD\" (2022), \"Salty Road Dogs Victory Anthem\" (2023) and \"Come With Fierce Grace\" (2023) arriving in close succession. His drift between jazz and spoken word sounds like no one else.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/alabaster_deplume/","bandcamp":"https://alabasterdeplume.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"juana-molina","name":"Juana Molina","country":"ARGENTINA","genre":"LIVE","image":"images/artists/juana-molina.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"ブエノスアイレスのシンガーソングライター。ささやくような歌と反復するエレクトロニクスを重ね合わせる。『Un Día』『Halo』など、国際的に評価されたアルバムを重ねてきた。実験的でありながら、耳に残るポップの手触りを失わない。","bio_en":"A Buenos Aires singer-songwriter who layers whispered vocals over looping electronics. Across acclaimed albums including \"Un Día\" and \"Halo\", her work stays experimental without losing the feel of pop that lodges in the ear.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/SOYJUANAMOLINA/","bandcamp":"https://juanamolina.bandcamp.com/","website":"https://juanamolina.com"}},{"id":"suimin","name":"Suimin","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO/HOUSE/ELECTRONIC","image":"images/artists/suimin.webp","bio":"東京を拠点とするDJ。Bonoboのパーティー「渦」に空中水泳らと並んで出演を重ね、Débrisの「FREEDOM無国籍HOUR」やBonoboの「MAMACULT」にも繰り返し名を連ねる。野外ではruralに2023年と2026年に出演している。","bio_en":"Suimin is a Tokyo DJ who turns up again and again at Bonobo's 渦 (Uzu) nights alongside 空中水泳, as well as FREEDOM無国籍HOUR at Débris and MAMACULT at Bonobo. Outdoors, Suimin has played rural in both 2023 and 2026.","name_en":"Suimin","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/djsuimin/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/min-ing"}},{"id":"dj-krush","name":"DJ KRUSH","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HIPHOP","image":"images/artists/dj-krush.webp","bio":"東京生まれのDJ/プロデューサー。1987年に MURO、DJ GO と KRUSH POSSE を結成し、1992年の解散後にソロ活動を本格化させた。1994年に1stアルバム『KRUSH』を、同年 Mo' Wax から『Strictly Turntablized』を発表。2001年の『Zen』は米 AFIM の最優秀エレクトロニカ・アルバム賞を受けた。2026年には新作『TOKYØHUM』を発表した。","bio_en":"Tokyo-born DJ/producer DJ Krush formed KRUSH POSSE with MURO and DJ GO in 1987 and went solo after the group split in 1992. His debut album \"KRUSH\" and \"Strictly Turntablized\" on Mo' Wax both came out in 1994. \"Zen\" (2001) won the AFIM award for Best Electronica Album in the US, and his new album \"TOKYØHUM\" was announced in 2026.","name_en":"DJ KRUSH","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/djkrushofficial","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/dj-krush-official","website":"https://djkrush.jp/"}},{"id":"zundoko-disco","name":"ZUNDOKO DISCO","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/zundoko-disco.webp","bio":"BOWとSISINOBUによるDJデュオ。東北で10年にわたりパーティーを手がけたのち、東京に拠点を移した。B2Bはストレートなテクノから始まり、アブストラクトなビートやドラムンベースへと幅を広げてきた。ソウルのvurt.のポッドキャストにミックスを提供し、12時間におよぶロングセットにも取り組む。","bio_en":"DJ duo of BOW and SISINOBU, now based in Tokyo after a decade of throwing parties in the Tohoku region. Their B2B sets started out as straight techno and have since stretched into abstract beats and drum and bass. They have recorded a mix for the podcast of vurt. in Seoul and take on long sessions running up to 12 hours.","name_en":"ZUNDOKO DISCO","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/zundokodisco/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/zundokodisco"}},{"id":"calpiss","name":"CALPISS","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HOUSE/DISCO","image":"images/artists/calpiss.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"東京のDJ。三軒茶屋の天狗食堂でパーティー CALPISS SOUR を、石垣島で TAKARAJIMA を主催している。高揚感のあるカラフルなディスコから、ヒプノティックなミニマルのグルーヴまでを得意とする。","bio_en":"A Tokyo DJ who runs the party CALPISS SOUR at Tengu Shokudo in Sangenjaya and TAKARAJIMA on Ishigaki Island. Sets range from euphoric, colourful disco to hypnotic minimal grooves.","name_en":"CALPISS","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/calpiss_ryo_yamazaki/"}},{"id":"space-drum-meditation","name":"Space Drum Meditation","city":"HAMBURG","country":"GERMANY","genre":"TECHNO/AMBIENT/ELECTRONIC","image":"images/artists/space-drum-meditation.webp","bio":"ハンブルクを拠点とするプロジェクト。打楽器を軸にしたトラックを作り、2018年の『SDM001』から続く自主の SDM シリーズを重ねてきた。2024年にはアルバム『Four Tusks』を発表している。","bio_en":"A Hamburg-based project built around percussion-driven tracks, releasing the self-run SDM series since SDM001 in 2018, with the album Four Tusks following in 2024.","name_en":"Space Drum Meditation","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/spacedrummeditation","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/spacedrummeditation","bandcamp":"https://spacedrummeditation.bandcamp.com"}},{"id":"aoki-takamasa","name":"AOKI Takamasa","city":"OSAKA","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO/HOUSE/AMBIENT/LIVE","image":"images/artists/aoki-takamasa.webp","bio":"1976年大阪生まれの電子音楽家で、写真家としても活動する。2001年に1stアルバム『SILICOM』を発表し、ヨーロッパを拠点に活動したのち、2011年に日本へ戻った。raster-notonから『RV8』（2013）などを出し、坂本龍一のリミックスも手がけている。リズムの変調を主題にした『Rhythm Variations』は、2009年のEPから続く長期のプロジェクトだ。","bio_en":"Osaka electronic musician and photographer, born in the city in 1976. His first album, SILICOM, came out in 2001, and after years based in Europe he moved back to Japan in 2011. His raster-noton releases include RV8 (2013), and his remix work includes a remix for Ryuichi Sakamoto. Rhythm Variations, a long-running project built around the modulation of rhythm, goes back to an EP in 2009.","name_en":"AOKI Takamasa","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/aokitakamasa/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/aoki-1","bandcamp":"https://aokitakamasa.bandcamp.com/","website":"http://www.aokitakamasa.com/"}},{"id":"daniel-bell","name":"DANIEL BELL","city":"BERLIN","country":"GERMANY","genre":"TECHNO/MINIMAL","image":"images/artists/daniel-bell.webp","bio":"ミニマル・テクノのDJ/プロデューサー。サクラメントに生まれ、トロント近郊で育ち、デトロイトでは Richie Hawtin と Cybersonik として活動した。1991年にレーベル Accelerate を立ち上げ、DBX 名義で「Losing Control」（1994）などを発表。2000年にベルリンへ移り、Tresor から初のミックスCD『The Button-Down Mind of Daniel Bell』を出した。","bio_en":"Minimal techno DJ and producer Daniel Bell was born in Sacramento, grew up outside Toronto, and worked with Richie Hawtin as Cybersonik in Detroit. In 1991 Bell started the Accelerate label and released a run of records as DBX, including \"Losing Control\" (1994). A move to Berlin followed in 2000, along with a first mix CD, \"The Button-Down Mind of Daniel Bell\", on Tresor.","name_en":"DANIEL BELL","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/danielbell_music/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/daniel-bell"}},{"id":"kohei","name":"Kohei","city":"KYOTO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO/HOUSE/MINIMAL","image":"images/artists/kohei.webp","bio":"京都を拠点とするテクノDJ。ミニマルなテクノやハウスを軸に、横揺れのグルーヴと剥き出しのファンクを重ねるプレイで知られる。2019年から、旧友の AOKI takamasa と大阪の Circus Osaka でレギュラーパーティー MONZA を主宰。各地のクラブやフェスに出演し、rural にも複数回出ている。","bio_en":"Kyoto-based techno DJ Kohei works through minimal techno and house, leaning on a swinging groove and stripped-down funk. Since 2019 he has run the regular party MONZA at Circus Osaka with his longtime friend AOKI takamasa, and he plays clubs and festivals across Japan, including several appearances at rural.","name_en":"Kohei","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/kohei_tempelgarten/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/kohei_t"}},{"id":"akiram-en","name":"AKIRAM EN","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/akiram-en.webp","bio":"90年代中盤よりDJとして活動開始。\nレフトフィールドテクノやアヴァンギャルドなどをフロアマナーに従ってミックスしていくエッジーなダンスセットから、オブスキュアサウンドに着想を得たディープなリスニングセットまで、聴覚と身体感覚を揺さぶるプレイは、ダンスフロアを常に意識しつつ、音楽を深く知覚させる体験へ導いていく。","bio_en":"Active as a DJ since the mid-'90s.\nFrom edgy dance sets that mix leftfield techno and avant-garde material according to the manners of the floor, through to deep listening sets drawn from obscure sound, his playing works on both the ears and the body — always conscious of the dancefloor, yet guiding the listener toward an experience of perceiving music at a far deeper level.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/akiram_en/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/akiram-en"}},{"id":"you-forgot","name":"You Forgot","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO/HOUSE/EXPERIMENTAL","image":"images/artists/you-forgot.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"東京を拠点とするDJ。サイケデリックなアンビエンスを土台に、ジャンルやBPMにとらわれずに混ぜていくセットを組む。都内では週末のアフターアワーズの時間帯を担うことが多く、Future TerrorやMindgamesといったパーティーにも呼ばれてきた。","bio_en":"Tokyo DJ who builds sets on a bed of psychedelic ambience and mixes freely across genres and tempos. You Forgot is a regular in the city's weekend after-hours slots and has been booked by parties such as Future Terror and Mindgames.","name_en":"You Forgot","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/youforgottt/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/youforgottt"}},{"id":"yellowuhuru","name":"YELLOWUHURU","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HOUSE","bio":"DJ／プロデューサー。パーティー兼レーベルFLATTOPを主宰し、ハウスを根底に置きながら電子音と生音を有機的に混ぜる。FLATTOPは2025年1月、渋谷WWWで10周年を迎えた。2024年6月にはSHIBUYA CLUB QUATTROで、バンドthe hatchとのオールナイト「NAKED ORANGE」を開いた。","bio_en":"DJ and producer, and the founder of FLATTOP, a party and label that marked its tenth anniversary at WWW in Shibuya in January 2025. House sits at the core, blended organically with electronics and live, acoustic sound. In June 2024 YELLOWUHURU teamed up with the band the hatch for NAKED ORANGE, an all-nighter at Shibuya CLUB QUATTRO.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/yellowuhuru/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/yellowuhuru"}},{"id":"clipz","name":"CLIPZ","city":"BRISTOL","country":"UK","genre":"DnB/HOUSE","image":"images/artists/clipz.webp","bio":"ブリストル出身のDJ/プロデューサー、Hugh Pescod のジャングル/ドラムンベース名義。2000年代初頭から Full Cycle や Digital Soundboy に作品を残し、2009年には Redlight 名義とレーベル Lobster Boy を立ち上げて、ハウスやベースミュージックへ活動を広げた。その名義での約10年を経て、原点である Clipz に戻ってきた。","bio_en":"Clipz is the jungle and drum & bass alias of Bristol DJ/producer Hugh Pescod. He released on Full Cycle and Digital Soundboy from the early 2000s, then in 2009 switched to Redlight and launched his Lobster Boy label, pushing into house and bass music. After a decade under that name, he has come back to Clipz and the sound he started with.","name_en":"CLIPZ","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/clipzuk/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/user-583430017","bandcamp":"https://clipzdubs.bandcamp.com/music"}},{"id":"dj-hype","name":"DJ HYPE","city":"LONDON","country":"UK","genre":"DnB","image":"images/artists/dj-hype.webp","bio":"本名 Kevin Ford。ロンドンのジャングル/ドラムンベースのDJ/プロデューサー。海賊ラジオ Fantasy FM で名を上げ、1993年に「Shot in the Dark」が全英チャート入り。1994年には Kiss 100 で番組を持った。レーベル Ganja Records を経て、DJ Zinc や Pascal らと True Playaz を結成。Fabric の Playaz でのジャンプアップのセットで知られる。","bio_en":"Kevin Ford, aka DJ Hype, is a London jungle and drum & bass DJ/producer. DJ Hype made a name on pirate station Fantasy FM, charted in 1993 with \"Shot in the Dark\", and had a show on Kiss 100 by 1994. The Ganja Records label led to True Playaz with DJ Zinc and Pascal, and the jump-up sets at the Playaz nights at Fabric are what many people know DJ Hype for.","name_en":"DJ HYPE","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/djhype_playaz/","website":"https://shop.playaz.co.uk/"}},{"id":"dj-masda","name":"DJ Masda","city":"BERLIN","country":"GERMANY","genre":"TECHNO/HOUSE","image":"images/artists/dj-masda.webp","bio":"静岡・富士山麓の出身で、ベルリンを拠点とするDJ。90年代からレコードを掘り続け、So Inagawa とともに東京のレーベル Cabaret Recordings を運営している。初期テクノ、未来的なエレクトロ、ハウスの遊び心を行き来し、短く効かせるミックスで新旧の曲をつないでいく。Bassiani、Dimensions、Resident Advisor、XLR8R などにミックスを提供している。","bio_en":"A Berlin-based DJ from the foot of Mt. Fuji in Shizuoka, digging vinyl since the '90s and running the Tokyo label Cabaret Recordings with So Inagawa. His selections move between early techno, futurist electro and the playful side of house, cut together with short, punchy mixes that put old and new side by side. He has recorded mixes for Bassiani, Dimensions, Resident Advisor and XLR8R.","name_en":"DJ MASDA","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/hauznated/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/hauznated"}},{"id":"guchon","name":"Guchon","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO/HOUSE/DnB","image":"images/artists/guchon.webp","bio":"東京のアンダーグラウンドなクラブシーンから出てきた、テクノ/ハウスのDJ/プロデューサー。Chiwax、Hot Haus Recs、Maximum Airtime、Moveltraxx、Trekkie Trax、System Records などからリリースしてきた。ハウスでもテクノでもブレイクスでも、キャッチーな旋律とファンキーなドラム、遊び心がトラックに通っている。イラストレーターでもあり、多くのリリースのジャケットを自作のキャラクターが飾る。","bio_en":"A techno and house DJ and producer from Tokyo's underground club scene, with releases on Chiwax, Hot Haus Recs, Maximum Airtime, Moveltraxx, Trekkie Trax and System Records. Whether the track is house, techno or breaks, expect catchy melodies, funky drums and a real sense of fun. He is also an illustrator, and his cute characters front many of his own sleeves.","name_en":"Guchon","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/guchon_dj/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/guchon","bandcamp":"https://guchon.bandcamp.com/","website":"https://guchon.com/"}},{"id":"kohra","name":"Kohra","city":"GOA","country":"INDIA","genre":"TECHNO/AMBIENT/TRANCE/DnB","image":"images/artists/kohra.webp","bio":"インド・ゴアを拠点とするDJ/プロデューサー。名前はウルドゥー語で「霧」を意味する。2011年にレーベル Qilla Records を設立し、2024年には100番目のリリースとして35組以上が参加したコンピレーション『Chakravyuh』を出した。セットはアンビエント、アシッド、トランス、テクノ、ジャングルを行き来する。作品は Bedrock や Spacelab からも出ている。","bio_en":"A DJ and producer based in Goa, India, whose name is Urdu for fog. Kohra founded Qilla Records in 2011, and in 2024 the label marked its 100th release with \"Chakravyuh\", a compilation of more than 35 artists. His sets drift through ambient, acid, trance, techno and jungle, and his own records have also landed on Bedrock and Spacelab.","name_en":"Kohra","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/kohra_","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/kohra","bandcamp":"https://kohra.bandcamp.com"}},{"id":"lady-shaka","name":"Lady Shaka","city":"LONDON","country":"UK","genre":"ELECTRONIC/HIPHOP/EXPERIMENTAL","image":"images/artists/lady-shaka.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"アオテアロア（ニュージーランド）出身、ロンドンを拠点とするアフロ・パシフィカのDJ。マオリ、タヒチ、カーボベルデなどにルーツを持つ。2019年に太平洋文化のコレクティブ Pulotu Underworld を立ち上げ、ディレクター兼キュレーターを務める。Boiler Room や Keep Hush にも出演。選曲には、クィアとしての自身と、海（モアナ）とディアスポラへのつながりが映る。","bio_en":"An Afro Pasifika DJ from Aotearoa, based in London, with Māori, Tahitian and Cape Verdean roots among others. In 2019 she founded Pulotu Underworld, the Pacific collective she still directs and curates, and she has played Boiler Room and Keep Hush. Her selections carry her queer identity as a femme queen and her ties to the moana, the ocean, and its diaspora.","name_en":"Lady Shaka","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/ladyshaka","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/ladyshaka","bandcamp":"https://ladyshaka.bandcamp.com/","website":"https://www.lady-shaka.com"}},{"id":"moodman","name":"MOODMAN","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HOUSE","image":"images/artists/moodman.webp","bio":"東京のハウス・シーンを長年支えてきたDJ。GODFATHER、HOUSE OF LIQUID、SLOWMOTION など複数のパーティーに深く関わり、日本のクラブカルチャーを現場から形づくってきた存在として知られる。","bio_en":"A DJ who has long shaped Tokyo's house scene from the ground up, deeply involved in parties such as GODFATHER, HOUSE OF LIQUID and SLOWMOTION.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/moodman10/"}},{"id":"nasthug","name":"nasthug","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HIPHOP","image":"images/artists/nasthug.webp","bio":"東京を拠点とするDJ。千葉生まれで、ジャマイカ人の父と日本人の母を持つ。ヒップホップを軸に、ダンスホール、ジャージー・クラブ、アフロビートまで、ジャンルを決めずにプレイする。2023年に出演した Boiler Room Tokyo のセットで国外からも注目を集め、同年にはエージェンシー Wasserman と契約し、アジア10か所を回るツアーを行った。","bio_en":"A Tokyo DJ born in Chiba to a Jamaican father and a Japanese mother. Her sets run from hip hop into dancehall, Jersey club and Afrobeat without settling into one lane. A 2023 Boiler Room Tokyo set brought international attention, and the same year she signed with the agency Wasserman and toured ten stops across Asia.","name_en":"nasthug","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/nasthug/"}},{"id":"okadada","name":"okadada","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HOUSE","image":"images/artists/okadada.webp","bio":"全国各地、多岐にわたるパーティーでDJとして出演し、ネットレーベル「maltine records」やbandcampで楽曲をリリース。大小、上下、場所、種別を問わず野外フェスから地下のパーティーまで出演、遊び、類例の無い幅広さの活動で各所に存在、評価を確立する。","bio_en":"Performing as a DJ at a wide range of parties across Japan, with releases on the net label maltine records and on Bandcamp. Appearing at—and simply hanging out at—everything from outdoor festivals to underground parties, regardless of scale, status, location or genre, he has carved out a presence and earned recognition across the board through an unparalleled breadth of activity.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/okadada/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/okadada","bandcamp":"https://halooo.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"paquita-gordon","name":"Paquita Gordon","country":"ITALY/SPAIN","genre":"TECHNO/HOUSE/AMBIENT/DnB/TRANCE","image":"images/artists/paquita-gordon.webp","bio":"イタリアとスペインを拠点に、すべてレコードでプレイするDJ。セットには二つの顔がある。サイケデリア、ブラックミュージック、アンビエント、ダブ、フォーク、スピリチュアルジャズをめぐるコズミックな面と、ハウスやテクノからドラムンベース、トランスまでを通るクラブの面だ。音の部族的なルーツと、ライブ音楽が持つ儀式的で集団的な側面に関心を寄せる。RA のポッドキャスト RA.639 を手がけている。","bio_en":"A vinyl-only DJ working between Italy and Spain. Her sets have two sides: a cosmic one that moves through psychedelia, black music, ambient, dub, folk and spiritual jazz, and a club one that runs from house and techno to drum and bass and trance. She is drawn to the tribal roots of sound and the ritual, collective side of live music, and recorded RA.639 for the RA podcast.","name_en":"Paquita Gordon","links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/paquitagordon","website":"https://triangleagency.com/paquita-gordon/"}},{"id":"powder","name":"Powder","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HOUSE","image":"images/artists/powder.webp","bio":"長崎出身、2011年から東京を拠点とするDJ/プロデューサー Moko Shibata のソロ名義。2017年に CockTail d'Amore から EP『H』を発表。以降 Beats in Space、ESP Institute、The Trilogy Tapes などから作品を重ねている。細部まで作り込まれたトラックは、豊かな旋律とフロアのリズムを同時に持つ。レフトフィールド・ハウスの旗手として、国際的に名前が通っている。","bio_en":"The solo alias of Moko Shibata, born in Nagasaki and based in Tokyo since 2011. Her EP \"H\" arrived on CockTail d'Amore in 2017, followed by releases on Beats in Space, ESP Institute and The Trilogy Tapes. Her intensely detailed tracks hold rich melody and dancefloor rhythm at once, and her name now travels internationally as a leading figure in left-field house.","links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/thinner_groove","bandcamp":"https://thinnergroove.bandcamp.com/","website":"https://powd.jp/"}},{"id":"sherelle","name":"SHERELLE","city":"LONDON","country":"UK","genre":"DnB/TECHNO","image":"images/artists/sherelle.webp","bio":"ロンドンの DJ／プロデューサー。160BPM 以上の高速ダンスミュージックを軸にする。2020年に NAINA とレーベル HOOVERSOUND を共同設立し、黒人や LGBTQI のアーティストを支える BEAUTIFUL も運営する。デビューアルバム『WITH A VENGEANCE』を発表し、DJ Mag の Best of British 2025 で Breakthrough Producer を受賞した。","bio_en":"A London DJ and producer who has made 160bpm and up her home turf. She co-founded HOOVERSOUND with NAINA in 2020 and runs BEAUTIFUL, a project that opens studio access to Black and LGBTQI artists. She has released her debut album WITH A VENGEANCE and took DJ Mag's Best of British 2025 award for Breakthrough Producer.","name_en":"SHERELLE","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/sherelle_","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/iamsherelle","bandcamp":"https://sherelle.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"upsammy","name":"upsammy","city":"AMSTERDAM","country":"NETHERLANDS","genre":"TECHNO/DnB/AMBIENT/EXPERIMENTAL","image":"images/artists/upsammy.webp","bio":"アムステルダムを拠点とするプロデューサー／DJ。2020年に Dekmantel からデビューアルバム『Zoom』を発表した。ドラムマシン、Ableton、モジュラーシンセ、フィールドレコーディングだけで作った作品だ。同レーベルからは EP『Bend』（2021）と、ドラムンベースに振った『Open Catalyst』（2025）も出ている。De School のレジデントを務め、Whities からのリリースもある。","bio_en":"An Amsterdam-based producer and DJ whose debut album Zoom came out on Dekmantel in 2020, made with nothing more than an Analog Rytm, Ableton, a modular synth and field recordings. Dekmantel has since put out her Bend EP (2021) and Open Catalyst (2025), a turn toward drum and bass. She was a resident at De School and has also released on Whities.","name_en":"upsammy","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/upsammy_/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/upsammy","bandcamp":"https://upsammy.bandcamp.com/","website":"https://upsammy.com/"}},{"id":"occa","name":"Occa","city":"SAPPORO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/occa.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"北海道・札幌拠点。聖域とも称されるPrecious Hallで、自身のパーティ「ARCHIV」をホームとする。Womb「Telepath」、Mitsuki「Sect」などのオーガナイズも手がける。独自のサイケデリクスを探求するなかで吸収してきた多様な音楽観と精神性を、能動的なミキシングと緻密な構築力で形象化し、ダンスフロアに多次元的な構造を生み出す。空間や時間の感覚さえも分解し、体験者の知覚を拡張すること。それがプレイの目的に据えられている。アジア・ヨーロッパ諸国での定期的なブッキングを重ね、国内外の主要クラブ / フェスティバルに出演。近年はSpekki Webu、System Revival、Axces Recordingsと深く共鳴し、そのサイケデリックなネットワークは新たなフェイズに入っている。","bio_en":"Based in Sapporo, Hokkaido. His home floor is \"ARCHIV\" at Precious Hall, the club long regarded as a sanctuary in Japan. He also organizes \"Telepath\" at Womb and \"Sect\" at Mitsuki.\n\nThrough his own pursuit of psychedelics, he has absorbed a wide range of musical and spiritual perspectives, giving them form through active mixing and meticulous construction to build multidimensional structures on the dancefloor. The aim is to dissolve the sense of space and even time, and to expand the perception of everyone in the room.\n\nHe holds regular bookings across Asia and Europe, and has played major clubs and festivals in Japan and abroad. In recent years his resonance with Spekki Webu, System Revival and Axces Recordings has pushed his psychedelic network into a new phase.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/occa_occa_occa/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/oooccaaa"}},{"id":"ge-ology","name":"GE-OLOGY","city":"NEW YORK","country":"USA","genre":"HOUSE","image":"images/artists/ge-ology.webp","bio":"ボルティモア生まれ、80年代からニューヨークを拠点とするプロデューサー/DJ/ビジュアルアーティスト。Mos Def、Talib Kweli、Jill Scott、De La Soul らの作品を手がけてきた。ヒップホップ中心の制作を経て、2015年に Theo Parrish の Sound Signature から「Moon Circuitry」を発表。最初の制作参加は1993年、ボルティモアの The Basement Boys との仕事だった。","bio_en":"Born in Baltimore and based in New York since the 80s, GE-OLOGY is a producer, DJ and visual artist whose production credits include Mos Def, Talib Kweli, Jill Scott, De La Soul and Little Dragon's Yukimi Nagano. After years working mostly at hip hop tempos, he released \"Moon Circuitry\" featuring Mark de Clive-Lowe on Theo Parrish's Sound Signature in 2015. His first production credit goes back to 1993, with Baltimore house outfit The Basement Boys.","name_en":"GE-OLOGY","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/geology365","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/geology365","bandcamp":"https://ge-ology365.bandcamp.com"}},{"id":"idjut-boys","name":"Idjut Boys","city":"LONDON","country":"UK","genre":"HOUSE/DISCO","image":"images/artists/idjut-boys.webp","bio":"Dan Tyler と Conrad McDonnell によるロンドンのデュオ。同名のクラブナイトを母体にレーベル U-Star を始め、Noid、Droid と3つのレーベルを運営してきた。ダブの効いた、ディスコをサンプリングしたハウスで知られる。2012年に Smalltown Supersound から初のアルバム『Cellar Door』を発表。2025年には新しいレーベル Bite The Day を始めた。","bio_en":"Dan Tyler and Conrad McDonnell work out of a North London studio as Idjut Boys. They started U-Star off the back of their club night of the same name, went on to run Noid and Droid too, and became known for dub-heavy, disco-sampling house. Their first album, Cellar Door, came out on Smalltown Supersound in 2012, and in 2025 they launched a new label, Bite The Day.","name_en":"Idjut Boys","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/idjut_boys/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/idjutboys","bandcamp":"https://idjutboys.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"ysk","name":"YSK","city":"FUKUOKA","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/ysk.webp","imagePosition":"center","bio":"北九州出身。日本各地のクラブから野外パーティまで出演を重ね、ベルリン Berghain の Säule、プラハの Ankali をはじめ、ヨーロッパ各国、オーストラリア、メキシコ、アジア全域へのツアーを行う。世界各国のレーベルからMixをリリース。\nsound space α 主宰。パーティとポッドキャストを運営する「Undulate」、新たに始動したレーベル「EXPLORE」と、その活動は多岐にわたる。2021年からはOCCAとともにSECTを始動している。\nDJスタイルはTechnoを基軸としながら、立体的なテクスチャーのサウンドを重ね、有機的にストーリーを組み立てていく。","bio_en":"From Kitakyushu. He has played clubs and open-air parties across Japan, and toured Europe, Australia, Mexico and Asia, including Säule at Berghain in Berlin and Ankali in Prague. His mixes have been released by labels around the world.\nHe runs sound space α, the party and podcast series Undulate, and the recently launched label EXPLORE. Since 2021 he has also run SECT together with OCCA.\nHis DJing is built on techno, layering sound with a three-dimensional sense of texture and letting the story unfold organically.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/ysk_alpha/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/ysksaske","website":"https://linktr.ee/ysk_explore"}},{"id":"mr-disco-kid","name":"Mr. Disco Kid","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HOUSE/DISCO","image":"images/artists/mr-disco-kid.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"東京の DJ。10代から DJ と、レコードの個人ディーラーとして活動してきた。レア・グルーヴからハウス、テクノ、ワールドミュージックまでを掛ける。2024年と2025年にはヨーロッパをツアーし、ロンドンの Giant Steps で2年続けてオールナイトのセットを務めた。ディーラーとしては Gilles Peterson や Antal を顧客に持つ。","bio_en":"A Tokyo DJ who started out in his teens both behind the decks and as a private record dealer. His sets run from rare grooves to house, techno and world music. He toured Europe in 2024 and 2025, playing all night long at Giant Steps in London both years, and his dealing clients include Gilles Peterson and Antal.","name_en":"Mr. Disco Kid","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/mr_disco_kid","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/mrdiscokid"}},{"id":"so","name":"So","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/so.webp","bio":"仙台にて18歳でDJを始める。その後野外フェスティバル「The Labyrinth」のレジデントDJ兼オーガナイザーとして20年以上に渡り活動中。安定感のあるスムーズなミックスと徐々に高揚感を増す丁寧なストーリーメイクを自身のスタイルとし、長年に渡り完成度を高めて来た。\n近年は3回目の出演となるポルトガルのWaking Life、ポーランドのGarbicz、オランダのDraaimolen、ベルギーのLa Nature等、欧州の大型フェスに絶えず出演し続け、昨年もスペインのParal·lel Festival に出演しそのセットはハイライトとなり好評を博した。年々その存在感を示し続けている。","bio_en":"He began DJing in Sendai at the age of 18. Since then, he has spent more than two decades as resident DJ and organizer of the open-air festival The Labyrinth. His signature style — rock-solid, seamless mixing paired with meticulous storytelling that builds euphoria little by little — is something he has refined over many years.\n\nMore recently he has been a constant presence on Europe's major festival circuit, appearing at Waking Life in Portugal (for the third time), Garbicz in Poland, Draaimolen in the Netherlands and La Nature in Belgium, among others. Last year he also played Paral·lel Festival in Spain, where his set was hailed as one of the weekend's highlights. Year after year, his presence continues to grow.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/dj.so_/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/dj_so"}},{"id":"akira-arasawa","name":"Akira Arasawa","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HOUSE","image":"images/artists/akira-arasawa.webp","imagePosition":"center","bio":"東京を拠点とするプロデューサー／DJ。Chill Mountain Recordを軸に、Shango Record、Lump Record、TOTEM TRAXXなど海外のレーベルから作品を発表している。2022年と2023年にはイビサのRadio Sonicaからライブ配信を行い、2024年は韓国、クロアチア、タイ、メキシコでプレイした。DJではディープハウスやオーガニックハウスからニュー・トライバル・ディスコまでを行き来する。","bio_en":"Tokyo-based producer and DJ tied to Chill Mountain Rec, with tracks out on Chill Mountain Record, Shango Record, Lump Record, Totem Traxx and other overseas labels. Akira Arasawa streamed live from Radio Sonica's Ibiza studio in 2022 and 2023, and in 2024 played Goulashdisko and Modem in Croatia, Wonderfruit in Thailand and M.N. Roy in Mexico. Behind the decks, the sets move from deep and organic house to nu tribal disco.","name_en":"Akira Arasawa","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/akiraarasawa/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/akiraarasawa"}},{"id":"azu-tiwaline","name":"Azu Tiwaline","country":"FRANCE","genre":"TECHNO/LIVE/EXPERIMENTAL","image":"images/artists/azu-tiwaline.webp","bio":"チュニジアとフランスを拠点とするプロデューサー。サハラにある自身のルーツを掘り下げ、有機的な響きと荒々しさをあわせ持つ音を作る。デビュー・アルバム『Draw Me a Silence』をフランスのI.O.T. Recordsから2部作で発表し、Livity Soundからは『Magnetic Service E.P.』を出している。","bio_en":"Producer splitting her time between Tunisia and France, with music that digs into her roots in the Sahara and sets organic textures against raw ones. Her debut album Draw Me a Silence came out in two parts on France's I.O.T. Records, and the Magnetic Service EP followed on Livity Sound.","name_en":"Azu Tiwaline","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/azu.tiwaline","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/azu-tiwaline","bandcamp":"https://azutiwaline.bandcamp.com"}},{"id":"cmt","name":"CMT","city":"NAGANO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HOUSE/DISCO/TECHNO","image":"images/artists/cmt.webp","bio":"2000年活動スタート、現在長野県軽井沢在住。東京、大阪、奈良、長野と拠点を変えながら全国各地の最重要アンダーグラウンドパーティシーンと共鳴。ハウス、テクノ、ディスコ、チルアウト、エクスペリメンタルを自在に横断する、緻密なミックススキルと豊かなストーリー性を持ったプレイスタイルが特徴です。","bio_en":"Active since 2000, now based in Karuizawa, Nagano. Having shifted bases from Tokyo to Osaka, Nara and Nagano, they have resonated with the most vital underground party scenes across Japan. Their style is defined by meticulous mixing skills and a rich sense of narrative, moving freely between house, techno, disco, chill-out and experimental.","name_en":"CMT","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/xxcmtxx/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/dj_cmt"}},{"id":"dj-hi-c","name":"DJ HI-C","city":"OSAKA","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/dj-hi-c.webp","bio":"大阪を拠点とするDJ／プロデューサー。ターンテーブリスト・ユニットKireekとしてDMC World Championshipを5連覇したのち、テクノへ軸足を移した。関西の野外パーティーMOMENTの中心メンバーで、Toru Ikemoto、TENOとテクノ・レーベルaum recordingsを設立。2023年にはFUJI ROCK FESTIVALとFUTURE TERRORに出演した。","bio_en":"Osaka-based DJ and producer. As part of the turntablist unit Kireek, DJ HI-C won the DMC World Championship five years in a row before switching over to techno. A core member of MOMENT, the outdoor party in the Kansai region, and co-founder of the techno label aum recordings with Toru Ikemoto and TENO. 2023 brought sets at FUJI ROCK FESTIVAL in July and FUTURE TERROR at year's end.","name_en":"DJ HI-C","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/djhi__c/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/djhi-c-kireek","bandcamp":"https://aumrecordings.bandcamp.com/","website":"https://discoveryhi-c.com/"}},{"id":"chida","name":"CHIDA","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HOUSE","image":"images/artists/chida.webp","bio":"90年代初頭から東京のハウス・シーンで活動するDJ。12時間を超えるロングセットで知られる。2009年にレーベル「ene」を立ち上げ、Prins ThomasやEddie C、Cos Mes、Sly Mongooseらの作品を出してきた。自身のデビュー12インチ『Danca』はESP Instituteから出ている。","bio_en":"Tokyo DJ who has been part of the city's house scene since the early '90s, known for marathon sets that run well past 12 hours. In 2009 he launched the label ene, which has put out records by Prins Thomas, Eddie C, Cos Mes and Sly Mongoose among others. His debut 12\", Danca, came out on ESP Institute.","name_en":"CHIDA","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/chida1973","soundcloud":"https://ellarecords.jp/cdn/shop/articles/IMG_0805.webp?v=1721703250"}},{"id":"kazuma-onishi","name":"KAZUMA ONISHI","city":"OSAKA","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/kazuma-onishi.webp","bio":"メルボルン（ナーム）を拠点とする日本人DJ/プロデューサー。テクノを軸に、ミニマル、ハウス、エレクトロ、サイケデリックな要素を混ぜ合わせる。3曲を同時に重ねるミックスを多用し、ループやリズムが少しずつ形を変えていくセットを組み立てる。","bio_en":"Kazuma Onishi is a Japanese DJ and producer based in Naarm/Melbourne. His sets are rooted in techno and draw in minimal, house, electro and psychedelic elements, often with three tracks running at once so that loops and rhythms keep shifting.","name_en":"KAZUMA ONISHI"},{"id":"kyomi","name":"Kyomi","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HOUSE/TECHNO/ELECTRONIC/AMBIENT","image":"images/artists/kyomi.webp","imagePosition":"center","bio":"鏡民（Kyomi）は、東京を拠点に全国各地の現場でプレイするDJ。ジャンルの枠に収まらないエクスペリメンタルな選曲で、実験性とダンスフロアの快楽を同じセットの中で両立させる。東京ではWOMBやMitsukiへの出演が多く、2026年8月には台北のPawnshopでもプレイした。","bio_en":"Kyomi (鏡民) is a Tokyo-based DJ who plays parties all over Japan. Experimental, genre-blind selections drive sets that are as exploratory as they are fun to dance to. WOMB and Mitsuki are the most frequent Tokyo stops, and August 2026 brought a date at Pawnshop in Taipei.","name_en":"Kyomi","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/kyomi_togashi/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/user-202919141"}},{"id":"kuniyuki","name":"Kuniyuki","city":"SAPPORO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"LIVE/TECHNO/HOUSE","image":"images/artists/kuniyuki.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"札幌を拠点とするプロデューサー／DJ。作品の多くを東京のレーベルMule Musiqから発表してきた。2002年にはJoe ClaussellのNatural Resourceから、地元札幌のクラブに捧げた「Precious Hall」をリリース。2018年にはオランダのMusic From Memoryが、1986〜93年の自宅録音を『Early Tape Works』としてまとめた。Koss名義でも活動する。","bio_en":"Sapporo-based producer and DJ whose catalog lives largely on the Tokyo label Mule Musiq. In 2002 came \"Precious Hall\", a dedication to the hometown club scene, on Joe Claussell's Natural Resource. In 2018 the Dutch label Music From Memory gathered the 1986 to 1993 home recordings as Early Tape Works. Kuniyuki also records as Koss.","name_en":"Kuniyuki","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/kuniyuki_takahashi_music/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/kuniyuki-takahashi","bandcamp":"https://mulemusiq.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"hybrid-man","name":"Hybrid Man","city":"MELBOURNE","country":"AUSTRALIA","genre":"LIVE/TECHNO","image":"images/artists/hybrid-man.webp","bio":"メルボルン（ナーム）を拠点とする、Julien Huynh と Will Holden のデュオ。ハードウェアによるライブセットを軸に活動する。2019年に地元レーベル Paper-Cuts から初の EP『Lyrebird』、2022年に Butter Sessions から『Shapeshifting』を発表。2023年には Skylab Radio で、ダンスフロア向けではない曲をかける番組 Hearing Things を始めた。","bio_en":"Hybrid Man is the Naarm/Melbourne duo of Julien Huynh and Will Holden, built around hardware live sets. Their first EP, \"Lyrebird\", came out on local label Paper-Cuts in 2019, followed by \"Shapeshifting\" on Butter Sessions in 2022. In 2023 they started Hearing Things on Skylab Radio, a show for tracks that sit outside dancefloor styles.","name_en":"Hybrid Man","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/hybrid__man","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/hybridmn","bandcamp":"https://hybridman.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"jakojako","name":"JakoJako","city":"BERLIN","country":"GERMANY","genre":"LIVE/TECHNO","image":"images/artists/jakojako.webp","bio":"ベルリンを拠点とするプロデューサー/DJで、Berghain のレジデント。本名は Sibel Koçer。モジュラーシンセを中心にしたライブで知られ、シンセ専門店 SchneidersLaden で数年働いた。そこで出会った Daniel Miller の Mute から、2023年に EP『Verve』、2024年に『Segmente』を出し、2025年にはベトナムのテト（旧正月）の時期に録音したアルバム『Têt 41』を発表した。","bio_en":"JakoJako is Sibel Koçer, a Berlin producer, live performer and Berghain resident. Modular synthesis sits at the centre of her studio and stage work, and she spent several years at SchneidersLaden, the Berlin synth shop where she first met Mute founder Daniel Miller. Mute released her EPs \"Verve\" (2023) and \"Segmente\" (2024), then her album \"Têt 41\" (2025), recorded in Vietnam over the Tết Lunar New Year.","name_en":"JakoJako","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/jakojako_live/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/jakojako_live","bandcamp":"https://jakojako.bandcamp.com/","website":"https://jakojako.com/"}},{"id":"haruka","name":"Haruka","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/haruka.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"東京を拠点とするテクノDJ。DJ Nobu が2001年に千葉で始めたパーティー Future Terror に加わり、ともに続けてきた。Future Terror はのちに東京へ移り、海外のテクノを日本に紹介する場になった。アジア、オセアニア、南北アメリカ、ヨーロッパでもプレイしている。ダンスフロアと現代音楽のあいだを探るレーベル Protection を立ち上げた。","bio_en":"A Tokyo-based techno DJ who joined DJ Nobu at Future Terror, the party Nobu started in Chiba in 2001. It later moved to Tokyo and became an important route for international techno into Japan. Haruka plays regularly across Asia, Oceania and the Americas as well as in Europe, and runs Protection, a label exploring the margins between the dancefloor and contemporary music.","name_en":"Haruka","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/haruka_ptc","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/haruka_ptc","bandcamp":"https://protection1.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"herbalistek","name":"Herbalistek","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"BASS/DUBSTEP","image":"images/artists/herbalistek.webp","bio":"東京を拠点とするプロデューサー／DJデュオ。ダークでディープなベースミュージックを軸に、テクノやダブステップ、トラップ、ダウンテンポを取り込む。TREKKIE TRAXやBassrushなどからリリース。2019年にEDC JapanのDiscovery Projectに選ばれ、2024年にFUJI ROCK FESTIVALに初出演、同年米国でもプレイした。主宰イベント「SECTOR」ではGOTH-TRADやDJ KRUSHを迎えている。","bio_en":"Tokyo producer and DJ duo working in dark, deep bass music, pulling in techno, dubstep, trap and downtempo. They've released on TREKKIE TRAX, Bassrush and more, won EDC Japan's Discovery Project in 2019, and made their Fuji Rock debut in 2024, the same year they first played the US. Their own event, SECTOR, has hosted GOTH-TRAD and DJ KRUSH.","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/herbalistekmusic/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/herbalistekmusic","bandcamp":"https://herbalistekmusic.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"efdemin","name":"Efdemin","city":"BERLIN","country":"GERMANY","genre":"TECHNO/LIVE/AMBIENT","image":"images/artists/efdemin.webp","bio":"ベルリンを拠点とするDJ/プロデューサー、Phillip Sollmann のテクノ名義。2004年からハンブルクのレーベル Dial で作品を発表し、アルバム『Efdemin』（2007）、『Chicago』（2010）を同レーベルから出した。2019年には Ostgut Ton から『New Atlantis』を発表。ヴァイナル限定のレーベル naïf を主宰し、本名ではドローンやアンビエントの作品も手がける。","bio_en":"Efdemin is the techno name of Berlin-based DJ/producer Phillip Sollmann. He has released on Hamburg's Dial since 2004, including the albums \"Efdemin\" (2007) and \"Chicago\" (2010), and put out \"New Atlantis\" on Ostgut Ton in 2019. He runs the vinyl-only label naïf, and under his own name makes drone and ambient work.","name_en":"Efdemin","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/efdemin","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/efdemin","bandcamp":"https://efdemindial.bandcamp.com/album/efdemin","website":"https://onboardmusic.net/artist/efdemin"}},{"id":"anthony-linell","name":"Anthony Linell","city":"STOCKHOLM","country":"SWEDEN","genre":"TECHNO/EXPERIMENTAL","image":"images/artists/anthony-linell.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"ストックホルムのプロデューサー／DJ。Varg（Jonas Rönnberg）とともにレーベルNorthern Electronicsを運営する。初期はAbdulla Rashim名義で、同じ名前のレーベルから作品を出していた。近年は別名義を離れて本名で発表している。ノイズや実験音楽に近いLundin Oil、VargとのユニットUlwhednarでも活動し、テクノと実験的な電子音楽の両方にまたがる。","bio_en":"Stockholm producer and DJ who runs Northern Electronics with Varg (Jonas Rönnberg). His early records came out as Abdulla Rashim, on a label of the same name, while more recent work drops the aliases altogether. Alongside the techno there is Lundin Oil, which edges toward noise and experimental music, and Ulwhednar, his duo with Varg.","name_en":"Anthony Linell","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/anthony.linell/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/anthonylinell","bandcamp":"https://northernelectronics.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"vril","name":".VRIL","country":"GERMANY","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/vril.webp","bio":"ドイツのプロデューサー。2011年に Berghain でのプレイで注目を集めた。2014年に Giegling 傘下の Forum から初のアルバム『Torus』を発表。その後はアムステルダムの Delsin から『Portal』（2015）、『Anima Mundi』（2018）、『Alte Seele』（2021）、『Animist』（2023）とアルバムを重ねている。","bio_en":"A German producer who first drew attention playing Berghain in 2011. His debut album Torus came out in 2014 on Forum, the Giegling offshoot, and since then Amsterdam's Delsin has released a run of albums: Portal (2015), Anima Mundi (2018), Alte Seele (2021) and Animist (2023).","name_en":".VRIL","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/vril_01","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/vril_01","bandcamp":"https://vrilofficial.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"rrose","name":"Rrose","city":"CALIFORNIA","country":"USA","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/rrose.webp","bio":"カリフォルニアを拠点とするテクノのプロデューサー。自身のレーベル Eaux を運営し、Sandwell District、Stroboscopic Artefacts、Infrastructure から EP を出してきた。Bob Ostertag、Charlemagne Palestine、Lucy とはそれぞれ共作アルバムがある。初のソロアルバムは2019年の『Hymn to Moisture』。","bio_en":"A California-based techno producer who runs the Eaux label, with EPs on Sandwell District, Stroboscopic Artefacts and Infrastructure. Rrose has also made collaborative albums with Bob Ostertag, Charlemagne Palestine and Lucy. The first solo album, Hymn to Moisture, came out on Eaux in 2019.","name_en":"Rrose","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/rrose1921","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/rrose1921","bandcamp":"https://rrose.bandcamp.com","website":"http://rrose.ro"}},{"id":"goth-trad","name":"GOTH-TRAD","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"DUBSTEP","image":"images/artists/goth-trad.webp","bio":"東京を拠点とするプロデューサー/DJ。2006年から、自身のレーベル兼パーティー Back To Chill を東京で続けている。Mala に見出された「Cut End」が DEEP MEDi Musik から出て、2012年には同レーベルからアルバム『New Epoch』を発表した。2021年には Back To Chill から『SURVIVAL RESEARCH』を出している。","bio_en":"Tokyo producer and DJ GOTH-TRAD has run Back To Chill, a label and club night of the same name, in the city since 2006. Mala signed the track \"Cut End\" to DEEP MEDi Musik, and in 2012 the label released the album \"New Epoch\". \"SURVIVAL RESEARCH\" followed on Back To Chill in 2021.","name_en":"GOTH-TRAD","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/gothtrad/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/goth-trad","bandcamp":"https://backtochilltokyo.bandcamp.com/","website":"http://www.gothtrad.com"}},{"id":"risa-taniguchi","name":"RISA TANIGUCHI","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/risa-taniguchi.webp","bio":"東京を拠点とするDJ／プロデューサー。歪んだシンセとアシッドなベース、加工した自身のボイスサンプルを軸にテクノを作る。Chris Liebing主宰のCLRから「Break It EP」を発表し、Second Stateにも作品を残す。「So Loud EP」はBeatportのTechno (Raw/Deep/Hypnotic) チャートで1位を記録。東京のWOMB、ソウルのUndercityでレジデントを務める。","bio_en":"Tokyo-based DJ and producer making techno out of distorted synths, acid bass and processed vocal samples of RISA TANIGUCHI's own voice. Chris Liebing's CLR put out the Break It EP, and there are releases on Second State too. The So Loud EP went to No. 1 on Beatport's Techno (Raw/Deep/Hypnotic) chart. Residencies include WOMB in Tokyo and Undercity in Seoul.","name_en":"RISA TANIGUCHI","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/risa_taniguchi_rs/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/risataniguchi","website":"https://www.risataniguchi.com/"}},{"id":"shhhhh","name":"Shhhhh","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO/HOUSE/ELECTRONIC","image":"images/artists/shhhhh.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"東京を拠点とするDJ。世界各地の民族音楽のリズムと電子音を、ひとつのグルーヴにつなぐ。Boredomsの周辺コミュニティでツアーを支え、ときに彼らのためにDJもした経験を持つ。2018年秋からはホーチミンのThe Observatoryのレジデント。「Gamelan Mix」はResident AdvisorのMix of the Dayに選ばれた。レーベル「El Folklore Paradox」を掲げ、EACH STORYではラインナップの助言役を務める。","bio_en":"Tokyo DJ Shhhhh threads folk and traditional rhythms from around the world into electronic dance music. Time spent in the extended circle around Boredoms meant helping on tours and sometimes DJing for the band, and since fall 2018 Shhhhh has held a residency at The Observatory in Ho Chi Minh City. The Gamelan Mix, made during the pandemic, was picked as RA's Mix of the Day. Shhhhh also advises on the lineup for EACH STORY and runs El Folklore Paradox, a concept and label built on the idea that traditional music and the newest techno share the same DNA.","name_en":"Shhhhh","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/shhhhh_kaneko/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/shhhhhsunhouse"}},{"id":"sara-landry","name":"Sara Landry","city":"AUSTIN","country":"USA","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/sara-landry.webp","bio":"テキサス州オースティンを拠点とする DJ／プロデューサー。制作とエンジニアリングを独学で身につけ、インダストリアル・テクノを T-Minus、Kraftek、mau5trap から発表してきた。ウェアハウスと配信のイベントシリーズ KLUBHAUS を主宰する。2026年の Ultra Music Festival では Amelie Lens と B2B を行い、アルバム『Divine Intervention』を発表している。","bio_en":"An Austin, Texas DJ and producer, self-taught in both production and audio engineering, whose industrial techno has landed on T-Minus, Kraftek and mau5trap. She runs KLUBHAUS, a warehouse and livestream event series, went B2B with Amelie Lens at Ultra Music Festival in 2026, and has her album Divine Intervention out now.","name_en":"Sara Landry","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/saralandrydj","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/sara-landry-dj","bandcamp":"https://saralandry.bandcamp.com/","website":"https://saralandry.com"}},{"id":"peggy-gou","name":"Peggy Gou","city":"BERLIN","country":"GERMANY","genre":"HOUSE","image":"images/artists/peggy-gou.webp","bio":"韓国出身、ベルリンを拠点とするDJ/プロデューサー。2016年に Rekids からEP『September War』を出して作品を発表し始め、2019年に自身のレーベル Gudu Records を立ち上げた。2023年のシングル「(It Goes Like) Nanana」を経て、2024年6月に XL Recordings からデビュー・アルバム『I Hear You』を発表している。","bio_en":"A Korean-born, Berlin-based DJ and producer. Her first release, the \"September War\" EP, came out on Rekids in 2016, and in 2019 she launched her own label, Gudu Records. The 2023 single \"(It Goes Like) Nanana\" led into her debut album \"I Hear You\", released on XL Recordings in June 2024.","name_en":"Peggy Gou","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/peggygou_/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/peggygou","bandcamp":"https://peggygou.bandcamp.com/","website":"https://www.peggygou.com/"}},{"id":"joris-voorn","name":"Joris Voorn","city":"AMSTERDAM","country":"NETHERLANDS","genre":"TECHNO/HOUSE","image":"images/artists/joris-voorn.webp","bio":"オランダ・ティルブルフ生まれ、アムステルダムを拠点とするDJ/プロデューサー。2004年の「Incident」で名を広め、同じ年に Sino からアルバム『Future History』を発表した。2005年に Edwin Oosterwal とレーベル Green を立ち上げ、『From A Deep Place』（2007）や『Nobody Knows』（2014）を出した。Rejected も運営し、Spectrum を主宰する。","bio_en":"Born in Tilburg and based in Amsterdam, Joris Voorn broke through with \"Incident\" in 2004, the same year his debut album \"Future History\" came out on Sino. In 2005 he founded Green with Edwin Oosterwal, home to \"From A Deep Place\" (2007) and \"Nobody Knows\" (2014), and he also runs the house-leaning Rejected. Spectrum is his radio show and event series.","name_en":"Joris Voorn","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/jorisvoorn","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/joris-voorn","bandcamp":"https://jorisvoorn.bandcamp.com/music","website":"http://www.jorisvoorn.com"}},{"id":"noco","name":"NOCO","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/noco.webp","bio":"2013年から続く野外パーティーPARAMOUNTの主宰メンバーで、レジデントDJ。1995年からDJを続け、日本のアンダーグラウンド・トランスシーンの黎明期にルーツを持つ。テクノとトランスの深部を行き来し、同じセットを二度と繰り返さないことを信条とする。国外ではタイのWonderfruit、韓国のvurt.でもプレイしている。","bio_en":"Co-organizer and resident DJ of PARAMOUNT, the open-air party running since 2013. NOCO has been DJing since 1995, with roots in the early days of Japan's underground trance scene, and works the deeper ends of techno and trance with a rule of never playing the same set twice. Outside Japan she has played Wonderfruit in Thailand and vurt. in South Korea.","name_en":"NOCO","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/noco_paramount/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/noco_paramount"}},{"id":"foodman","name":"Foodman","city":"AICHI","country":"JAPAN","genre":"LIVE/ELECTRONIC/TECHNO","image":"images/artists/foodman.webp","bio":"名古屋を拠点とするプロデューサー/DJ/画家。食品まつり a.k.a foodman として、ジューク/フットワークを足場にアンビエントやハウス、ノイズまでを解体して組み直す音を作る。米国の Orange Milk からデビューアルバムを出し、Good Enuff などからも作品を発表。Hyperdub から出たアルバム『Yasuragi Land』は Pitchfork の2021年のベスト・エレクトロニックに選ばれた。","bio_en":"Nagoya-based producer, DJ and painter Takahide Higuchi, aka Shokuhin Matsuri or foodman, starts from juke and footwork and pulls in ambient, house and noise, taking each apart and reassembling it. His debut album came out on Orange Milk, with later records on labels including Good Enuff, and \"Yasuragi Land\" on Hyperdub made Pitchfork's best electronic music of 2021.","name_en":"Foodman","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/tyousinkai/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/shokuhin-maturi","bandcamp":"https://foodman.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"sapphire-slows","name":"Sapphire Slows","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"LIVE","image":"images/artists/sapphire-slows.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"東京のプロデューサー／DJ。2011年に寝室で制作を始め、LAのNot Not Funと東京のBig Loveからデビュー。その後ベルリンのNous DisquesやUKのKaleidoscopeからも作品を出し、2014年にアルバム『Allegoria』を発表した。シンセに囁くような自身の声を重ねる。2015年にRed Bull Music Academy（パリ）に参加し、2018年にロンドンのRinse FMのレジデントとなった。","bio_en":"Tokyo producer and DJ who started making tracks in her bedroom in 2011 and debuted on LA's Not Not Fun and Tokyo's Big Love. Releases followed on Berlin's Nous Disques and the UK's Kaleidoscope, including the 2014 album Allegoria, with her own hushed vocals drifting over the synths. She took part in Red Bull Music Academy in Paris in 2015 and became a Rinse FM resident in London in 2018.","name_en":"Sapphire Slows","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/sapphireslows/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/sapphire-slows","bandcamp":"https://sapphireslows.bandcamp.com/music"}},{"id":"olive-oil","name":"Olive Oil","city":"FUKUOKA","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HIPHOP","image":"images/artists/olive-oil.webp","bio":"福岡を拠点とするプロデューサー／リミキサー／DJ。画家・VJのPopy Oilと2002年頃に始めた九州のクリエイティブ・レーベルOILWORKSの中心にいて、作品の制作から流通、国内外のツアーまでを自分たちの手で回す。カセットのみのビートテープ『PROTO TAPE』やジャズミックス『SOURCE JAZZ』など形を変えながら作品を出し続け、2026年10月に7枚目のアルバム『VITAMIN O』を発表した。","bio_en":"Fukuoka-based producer, remixer and DJ. Around 2002 Olive Oil started OILWORKS with painter and VJ Popy Oil, a Kyushu label and crew that does everything in-house, from pressing and distributing records, tapes and apparel to running tours in Japan and abroad. The formats keep changing, from the cassette-only beat tape PROTO TAPE to the jazz mix SOURCE JAZZ, and October 2026 brought VITAMIN O, the seventh album.","name_en":"Olive Oil","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/olvoill/","bandcamp":"https://oliveoil.bandcamp.com/","website":"http://www.oilworks.jp/"}},{"id":"levolant","name":"LEVOLANT","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO/HOUSE/ELECTRONIC","image":"images/artists/levolant.webp","bio":"2001年生まれ、東京を拠点とするDJ。東京・Mitsukiのレジデントを務める。DJバーから野外フェスティバルまで場数を重ね、電子音楽を土台にハウス、テクノ、エレクトロミニマルを行き来するセットを組む。近年はアジアにも活動の場を広げている。","bio_en":"Tokyo DJ, born in 2001, and a resident at Mitsuki in Tokyo. LEVOLANT has put in the hours everywhere from small DJ bars to open-air festivals, building sets that move between house, techno and electro-minimal on an electronic foundation, and lately has been taking that out across Asia.","name_en":"LEVOLANT","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/_levolant/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/levolant"}},{"id":"yama","name":"YAMA","city":"OSAKA","country":"JAPAN","genre":"HOUSE/TECHNO","image":"images/artists/yama.webp","bio":"大阪を拠点とするDJ。1994年にDJを始め、DMR大阪での勤務を経て、newtone recordsに開店時からバイヤーとして関わってきた。2000年前後にはEYEとパーティー「eep」を主宰。ハウスを軸に、テクノやブレイクビーツ、ジャズまでをその場に合わせて行き来する。札幌PRECIOUS HALLに定期的に出演し、近年はロンドンのfabric、ソウルのNyapi、タイのWonderfruitでもプレイしている。","bio_en":"Osaka-based YAMA started DJing in 1994. After working at DMR Osaka, YAMA joined newtone records as a buyer when the shop opened, and around the turn of the millennium ran the party eep with EYE. The sets center on house but move through techno, breakbeats and jazz depending on the room. YAMA plays regularly at Precious Hall in Sapporo and has recently played fabric in London, Nyapi in Seoul and Wonderfruit in Thailand.","name_en":"YAMA","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/yama72yama/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/ya-ma"}},{"id":"architectural","name":"Architectural","city":"CATALONIA","country":"SPAON","genre":"TECHNO/EXPERIMENTAL/LIVE","image":"images/artists/architectural.webp","imagePosition":"center","bio":"スペイン・アストゥリアス出身、カタルーニャ拠点のプロデューサー／DJ。Reeko名義で知られるJuan Ricoの別名義で、当初は匿名だった。自身のレーベルArchitectural Recordsから2010〜2014年に5作を出し、オランダのWolfskuilからは『Amour』（2015）を発表。PoleGroupからはReeko & Architectural名義の『The Blue Album』（2013）を出した。","bio_en":"Asturian producer and DJ based in Catalonia, and the second project of Juan Rico, better known as Reeko. It started out anonymous. Five records came out on his own Architectural Records between 2010 and 2014, with Amour following on the Dutch label Wolfskuil in 2015. The two aliases met on The Blue Album, credited to Reeko & Architectural, released on PoleGroup in 2013.","name_en":"Architectural","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/_architectural_/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/architectural-1","bandcamp":"https://architecturalrecs.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"donato-dozzy","name":"Donato Dozzy","country":"ITALY","genre":"TECHNO/LIVE/EXPERIMENTAL","image":"images/artists/donato-dozzy.webp","bio":"イタリアのDJ/プロデューサー。ローマのクラブ Brancaleone（1999年〜）、ベルリンの Panorama Bar（2004〜2006年）でレジデントを務めた。2007年に初めて Labyrinth に招かれ、翌2008年にはクロージングを担当。2008年にレーベル Aquaplano を始め、2010年に初アルバム『K』を発表した。Neel とのユニット Voices From The Lake でも活動する。","bio_en":"Italian DJ/producer Donato Dozzy held residencies at Brancaleone in Rome from 1999 and at Berlin's Panorama Bar from 2004 to 2006. Labyrinth first invited him in 2007, and he came back to close the festival in 2008. He started the Aquaplano label in 2008, released his debut album \"K\" in 2010, and also works with Neel as Voices From The Lake.","name_en":"Donato Dozzy","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/donato_dozzy","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/donato-dozzy","bandcamp":"https://dozz.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"jonathan-fitoussi","name":"Jonathan Fitoussi","city":"PARIS","country":"FRANCE","genre":"HOUSE/MINIMAL/LIVE","image":"images/artists/jonathan-fitoussi.webp","bio":"パリを拠点とするサウンドアーティスト（1978年生まれ）。ミニマルで現代音楽的な形式を軸に、電子音とアコースティックの音を組み合わせる。Clemens Hourrière とは、ストックホルムの EMS で Buchla 200 を使って録った『Five Steps』を2015年に Versatile から出した。Suzanne Ciani や JB Dunckel との共作もある。","bio_en":"Paris-based sound artist Jonathan Fitoussi (born 1978) works in minimalist and contemporary forms, blending electronic and acoustic sound. With Clemens Hourrière he recorded \"Five Steps\" on a Buchla 200 during a residency at EMS in Stockholm, released by Versatile in 2015. His catalogue also includes collaborations with Suzanne Ciani (\"Golden Apples Of The Sun\") and JB Dunckel (\"Mirages\").","name_en":"Jonathan Fitoussi","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/jonathanfitoussi_","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/jonathanfitoussi","bandcamp":"https://jfitoussi.bandcamp.com"}},{"id":"peter-van-hoesen","name":"Peter Van Hoesen","city":"HAKUBA","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO/EXPERIMENTAL/LIVE","image":"images/artists/peter-van-hoesen.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"ベルギー出身のプロデューサー、ライブ・パフォーマー、サウンドデザイナー。低音の効いた抽象的なテクノで知られ、レーベル Time To Express と Center 91 を主宰する。Yves De Mey とのユニット Sendai では Editions Mego などから作品を出し、Atom™ とはライブ・プロジェクト SYNC. を組む。The Labyrinth には、2017年に Donato Dozzy と並ぶレジデントとして出演した。","bio_en":"A Belgian producer, live performer and sound designer best known for a bass-heavy, abstract take on techno. He runs the labels Time To Express and Center 91, records with Yves De Mey as Sendai, with albums on Editions Mego among others, and plays live with Atom™ as SYNC. In 2017 he topped the bill at The Labyrinth as a resident alongside Donato Dozzy.","name_en":"Peter Van Hoesen","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/petervanhoesen","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/petervanhoesen","bandcamp":"https://timetoexpress.bandcamp.com","website":"https://petervanhoesen.com/"}},{"id":"petar-dundov","name":"Petar Dundov","city":"ZAGREB","country":"CROATIA","genre":"TECHNO/LIVE","image":"images/artists/petar-dundov.webp","bio":"クロアチア・ザグレブのプロデューサー。1970年代初めに同地で生まれ、本名で作品を出し始めたのは2000年代に入ってから。ベルギーの Music Man と長く関わり、2008年に同レーベルからデビュー・アルバム『Escapements』を発表した。Jeff Mills のレーベル Tomorrow からはミニLP『Sculptures』を出している。複雑な旋律と、ゆっくり熱を上げていく催眠的な展開を持つテクノで知られる。","bio_en":"A Zagreb producer, born in the city in the early 70s, who only began releasing under his own name after 2000. A long relationship with Belgium's Music Man produced his 2008 debut album \"Escapements\", and he made the \"Sculptures\" mini LP for Jeff Mills' Tomorrow label. His techno is known for intricate melodies and slow-burning, hypnotic progressions.","name_en":"Petar Dundov","links":{"instagram":"http://instagram.com/petardundov","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/petardundov","bandcamp":"https://petardundov.bandcamp.com","website":"http://www.petardundov.com"}},{"id":"napirelly","name":"Napirelly","country":"RUSSIA","genre":"TECHNO/DnB/ELECTRONIC/BASS","image":"images/artists/napirelly.webp","bio":"レニングラード生まれ、北極圏に接するシベリアの街で育ったDJ。2009年から活動し、Tresor などでプレイを重ねてきた。ブレイクス、エレクトロ、ベース、テクノを、BPMを大きく動かしながらつなぐ。2020年に Delta Funktionen とユニット Immediate Proximity を結成し、Radio Matrix からLP『2334』を発表。2023年には2人のレーベル IMPROX を立ち上げた。","bio_en":"Born in Leningrad and raised near the Arctic Circle in Siberia, Napirelly has been DJing since 2009, with Tresor among the rooms along the way. Her sets juggle breaks, electro, bass and techno with big swings in tempo. In 2020 she formed Immediate Proximity with Delta Funktionen, releasing the LP \"2334\" on Radio Matrix, and in 2023 the pair started their own label, IMPROX.","name_en":"Napirelly","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/napirelly","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/napirelly"}},{"id":"reek","name":"REE.K","city":"MIYAZAKI","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/reek.webp","bio":"東京出身のDJ。1980年代半ばに楽曲制作を始め、1992年からDJとして活動する。1997年にパーティー Space Gathering を始め、国内レイブシーンの形成に関わった。2001年のミックスCD『Cubism』、2002年に立ち上げたレーベル Hypnodisk など、作品の発表も重ねてきた。これまで10か国以上でプレイ。2012年以降は九州に拠点を移し、自給自足の暮らしを送っている。","bio_en":"A Tokyo-born DJ who began making music in the mid-1980s and has been DJing since 1992. She launched the party Space Gathering in 1997 and helped build Japan's domestic rave scene, released the mix CD \"Cubism\" in 2001 and started her own label, Hypnodisk, in 2002. She has played in more than ten countries, and since 2012 has lived self-sufficiently in Kyushu.","name_en":"REE.K","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/ree_k","soundcloud":"https://www.mixcloud.com/reek2013/"}},{"id":"dj-sodeyama","name":"DJ SODEYAMA","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO/HOUSE/AMBIENT","image":"images/artists/dj-sodeyama.webp","bio":"東京出身のDJ/プロデューサー。テクノ、ハウスからアンビエント、ダウンビートまでを軸に活動する。DJ SODEYAMA 名義では Nina Kraviz のレーベル трип をはじめ、Dynamic Reflection、Quartz などからリリース。別名義 THE PEOPLE IN FOG では Sound Of Vast から EP を重ね、2021年のアルバム『1977』は The Vinyl Factory の年間ベスト50に選ばれた。","bio_en":"A Tokyo-born DJ and producer whose work runs from techno and house through ambient and downtempo. As DJ Sodeyama there are releases on Nina Kraviz's трип, Dynamic Reflection and Quartz. As The People In Fog, a run of EPs on Sound Of Vast led to the 2021 album \"1977\", which made The Vinyl Factory's list of the 50 best albums of the year.","name_en":"DJ SODEYAMA","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/djsodeyama/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/arparecords","bandcamp":"https://masaseries.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"dj-kuri","name":"DJ KURI","city":"CHIBA","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/dj-kuri.webp","bio":"千葉県・房州出身、現在も同地に暮らすDJ。アンダーグラウンドパーティー〈BLACK FOREST〉を主宰し、そのDJとしてフロアに立つ。秘蔵のヴァイナルディープテクノコレクションを携えて、全国各地の怪奇的シーンを行脚し漆黒のグルーヴを奏でる","bio_en":"A DJ born and still based in Bōshū, Chiba Prefecture. He runs the underground party 〈BLACK FOREST〉, where he also takes to the floor as a DJ. Armed with a treasured collection of deep techno vinyl, he makes pilgrimages to the more uncanny corners of the scene across Japan, conjuring pitch-black grooves wherever he goes.","name_en":"DJ KURI","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/dj_kuri_bf/"}},{"id":"compuma","name":"COMPUMA","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO/HOUSE/EXPERIMENTAL","image":"images/artists/compuma.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"ADS（アステロイド・デザート・ソングス）、スマーフ男組での活動を経て、ジャンルを横断するDJとして全国各地の現場に立つ。自身のプロジェクト SOMETHING ABOUT からミックスCD「SOMETHING IN THE AIR」シリーズを発表し、コレクティヴ「悪魔の沼」でも活動する。2022年に初のソロアルバム『A View』、2024年に『horizons』をリリース。Berlin Atonal 2017 にも出演した。","bio_en":"COMPUMA came through the bands ADS (Asteroid Desert Songs) and Smerf Otoko-gumi before settling into a genre-crossing DJ practice that takes him to rooms all over Japan. His SOMETHING ABOUT project puts out the \"SOMETHING IN THE AIR\" mix CD series, and he is part of the collective Akuma no Numa. Solo albums \"A View\" (2022) and \"horizons\" (2024) followed, and he played Berlin Atonal in 2017.","name_en":"COMPUMA","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/compuma_km/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/compuma","bandcamp":"https://compuma.bandcamp.com/album/horizons"}},{"id":"max-cooper","name":"Max Cooper","city":"LONDON","country":"UK","genre":"LIVE","image":"images/artists/max-cooper.webp","imagePosition":"center","bio":"ロンドンを拠点とする電子音楽の作曲家/マルチメディア・アーティスト。計算生物学の博士号を持つ元研究者で、レーベル Mesh を主宰する。音楽と映像で芸術と科学の交差を探り、3D/AV ライブやインスタレーションを手がけてきた。2021年にはアテネのアクロポリスの古代劇場で公演。Zaha Hadid Architects などと協働し、V&A などで作品を展示している。","bio_en":"A London-based electronic composer and multimedia artist, and a former scientist with a PhD in computational biology, who runs the label Mesh. His work sits where art and science meet, built into 3D/AV live shows and installations. He played the ancient theatre at the Acropolis in Athens in 2021, has worked with Zaha Hadid Architects, and has shown work at the V&A.","name_en":"Max Cooper","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/maxcoopermax","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/max-cooper","website":"http://www.maxcooper.net"}},{"id":"lisa-mizuno","name":"LISA MIZUNO","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO/EXPERIMENTAL","image":"images/artists/lisa-mizuno.webp","bio":"音楽とダンスを、娯楽ではなく集合的な祈りのかたちとして捉えるDJ / アーティスト。コミュニティを結び、個を超えていく精神的な力としての音楽。その視点が表現の核にある。イベントシリーズ「Resonance レゾナンス」のオーガナイザー。日本の文化の根底をなす「間」「和」「祈り」といった要素を、現代の体験へと翻訳していく。その射程は音楽だけにとどまらず、空間のデザインや身体表現にも及び、ひとつの現代的な儀式として組み上げられる。","bio_en":"A DJ and artist who approaches music and dance not as entertainment but as a form of collective prayer. Music as a spiritual force that binds communities together and carries the individual beyond the self — this perspective sits at the core of the work. Organizer of the event series \"Resonance.\" Elements that form the bedrock of Japanese culture — *ma* (interval), *wa* (harmony), and prayer — are translated into contemporary experience. The scope reaches beyond music alone, extending into spatial design and physical expression, assembled into a single contemporary ritual.","name_en":"LISA MIZUNO","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/_lisa.m26__/","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/lisamizuno"}},{"id":"eve","name":"EVE","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO","image":"images/artists/eve.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"東京を拠点とするテクノ/ハードテクノのDJ/プロデューサー。2000年に韓国で生まれ、7歳で日本へ移った。2021年にDJを始め、2022年に FUJI ROCK FESTIVAL でデビュー。同年から楽曲制作も手がける。ハードテクノとハードコアのパーティー/レーベル VIXLATIXN を主宰し、パーティー TRAPEZE も運営。2024年にはベルリンの配信プラットフォーム HÖR に出演した。","bio_en":"EVE is a Tokyo-based techno and hard techno DJ/producer. Born in South Korea in 2000, she moved to Japan at seven, started DJing in 2021 and made her debut at FUJI ROCK FESTIVAL in 2022, the same year she began producing. She runs VIXLATIXN, a hard techno and hardcore party and label, along with the party TRAPEZE, and played Berlin's HÖR in 2024.","name_en":"EVE","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/eve_violet","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/eve_violet","bandcamp":"https://vixlatixn.bandcamp.com/"}},{"id":"mars89","name":"MARS89","city":"TOKYO","country":"JAPAN","genre":"TECHNO/DUBSTEP/AMBIENT","image":"images/artists/mars89.webp","imagePosition":"center top","bio":"東京を拠点に、DJ、ライブ、作曲、サウンドデザインを行き来して活動するアーティスト。Contact Tokyo でのオープン・トゥ・ラストのほか、ブリストル、ベルリン、ワルシャワ、台北、ソウル、上海でもプレイしてきた。ブリストルの Noods Radio ではレジデントを持つ。初期インダストリアル、ニューウェーブ、UKダブステップ、ブリストルのベース・カルチャーを下地に、テクノやアンビエント、映画のような空気感も取り込んでセットを組む。","bio_en":"A Tokyo artist working across DJing, live performance, composition and sound design. He has played open to last at Contact Tokyo, taken sets to Bristol, Berlin, Warsaw, Taipei, Seoul and Shanghai, and holds a residency on Bristol's Noods Radio. The sound pulls from early industrial, new wave, UK dubstep and Bristol bass culture, alongside techno, ambient and a filmic sense of atmosphere.","name_en":"MARS89","links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/mars89_nocturnal","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/mars89","bandcamp":"http://mars89.com"}}];

