const VENUES = [{"id":"womb","name":"WOMB","city":"TOKYO","area":"SHIBUYA","type":"club","name_kana":"ウーム","access":"JR渋谷駅ハチ公口から徒歩10分、京王井の頭線神泉駅から徒歩3分","access_en":"10 min walk from Shibuya Station (JR, Hachiko Exit); 3 min from Shinsen Station (Keio Inokashira Line)","image":"images/venues/womb.webp","genre":["TECHNO","HOUSE","MINIMAL","BASS","OTHERS"],"capacity":800,"address":"2-16 Maruyama-cho, Shibuya-ku, Tokyo","lat":35.6583,"lng":139.695,"url":"https://www.womb.co.jp/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/womb_tokyo/","desc_en":"WOMB stands as Tokyo's most iconic techno institution, housed in a striking underground space in Shibuya with a world-class sound system that has drawn international artists for over two decades. The venue's distinctive curved main floor and precise acoustics have cemented its reputation as a pilgrimage site for serious dance music enthusiasts.","desc":"WOMBは、渋谷の地下に構える東京を代表するテクノクラブ。世界水準のサウンドシステムを備え、20年以上にわたり国内外のアーティストを迎えてきた。曲線を描くメインフロアと精度の高い音響で知られ、ダンスミュージックを深く聴く層にとっての目的地となっている。"},{"id":"circus-tokyo","name":"CIRCUS TOKYO","city":"TOKYO","area":"SHIBUYA","type":"club","name_kana":"サーカス東京","image":"images/venues/circus-tokyo.webp","genre":["TECHNO","HOUSE","MINIMAL","BASS","OTHERS"],"capacity":300,"address":"3-26-16 Shibuya, Shibuya-ku, Tokyo","lat":35.6542,"lng":139.7056,"url":"https://circus-tokyo.jp/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/circus_tokyo/","desc_en":"CIRCUS TOKYO operates as a refined underground space in the heart of Shibuya, known for its carefully curated techno programming and intimate atmosphere. The venue attracts both established international artists and emerging local talent, maintaining a reputation for quality sound systems and discerning crowds. Its compact layout creates an immersive environment where the focus remains firmly on the music.","desc":"CIRCUS TOKYOは、渋谷の中心部にあるアンダーグラウンドな空間。丁寧に組まれたテクノのブッキングと親密な雰囲気で知られる。国際的に活動するアーティストから国内の新しい才能までを迎え、音響の質と客層の成熟さに定評がある。コンパクトなつくりが、音楽に集中できる環境を生んでいる。"},{"id":"saloon","name":"SALOON","city":"TOKYO","area":"DAIKANYAMA","type":"club","name_kana":"サルーン","access":"東急東横線代官山駅から徒歩1分","access_en":"1 min walk from Daikanyama Station (Tokyu Toyoko Line)","image":"images/venues/saloon.webp","genre":["TECHNO","HOUSE","OTHERS"],"capacity":150,"address":"Za-House Building B3F, 1-34-17 Ebisu-Nishi, Shibuya-ku, Tokyo","lat":35.6471,"lng":139.7023,"url":"https://saloon-tokyo.com/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/saloon_tokyo/","desc_en":"SALOON operates as a compact basement club in Shibuya, known for its intimate atmosphere and carefully curated lineups spanning techno, house, and experimental electronic music. The venue's low ceilings and minimal lighting create an immersive environment that prioritizes sound quality and dancefloor intimacy over spectacle. Its programming often features both emerging local talent and respected international artists within Tokyo's underground circuit.","desc":"SALOONは、渋谷の地下にある小規模なクラブ。テクノ、ハウス、実験的なエレクトロニックミュージックにまたがるラインナップで知られる。低い天井と抑えた照明が没入感のある空間をつくり、演出よりも音の質とフロアの近さを重視している。国内の新しい才能と、東京のアンダーグラウンドで評価される海外アーティストの双方を迎える。"},{"id":"solfa","name":"SOLFA","city":"TOKYO","area":"NAKAMEGURO","type":"club","name_kana":"ソルファ","image":"images/venues/solfa.webp","genre":["TECHNO","HOUSE","LIVE","OTHERS"],"capacity":200,"address":"Oak Build, 1-20-5 Aobadai, Meguro-ku, Tokyo.","lat":35.647,"lng":139.6981,"url":"https://nakameguro-solfa.com/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/solfa_nakameguro/","desc_en":"SOLFA occupies a basement space in Nakameguro, offering an intimate setting for electronic music with a sound system that prioritizes clarity over volume. The venue has cultivated a reputation for quality bookings across house and techno, attracting both local selectors and international artists to its compact dancefloor. Its understated approach and commitment to proper sound design has made it a respected destination within Tokyo's discerning underground community.","desc":"SOLFAは、中目黒の地下にあるクラブ。音量よりも解像度を重視したサウンドシステムで、エレクトロニックミュージックを親密な環境で聴かせる。ハウスとテクノを軸にしたブッキングで評価を得ており、国内のセレクターから海外アーティストまでがコンパクトなフロアに立つ。音響設計への姿勢が、東京のアンダーグラウンドで信頼を集めている。"},{"id":"unit","name":"UNIT","city":"TOKYO","area":"DAIKANYAMA","type":"livehouse","name_kana":"ユニット","access":"東急東横線代官山駅から徒歩2分","access_en":"2 min walk from Daikanyama Station (Tokyu Toyoko Line)","image":"images/venues/unit.webp","imagePosition":"center top","genre":["LIVE","OTHERS"],"capacity":200,"address":"ZaHOUSE, 1-34-17 Ebisu-Nishi, Shibuya-ku, Tokyo","lat":35.6471,"lng":139.7023,"url":"https://www.unit-tokyo.com/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/unit_tokyo/","desc_en":"UNIT stands as one of Tokyo's most respected underground venues, housed in a basement space in Daikanyama that prioritizes sound quality and intimate atmosphere over flashy production. The club's carefully curated programming spans techno, house, and experimental electronics, attracting both established international artists and Japan's finest selectors. Its compact layout and dedicated sound system create an immersive environment where music takes precedence over spectacle.","desc":"UNITは、代官山の地下にある東京有数のアンダーグラウンドクラブ。華美な演出よりも音質と空間の親密さを重視する。テクノ、ハウス、実験的なエレクトロニクスにまたがるブッキングで、海外の実力派と国内の主要なセレクターの双方を迎えてきた。コンパクトなつくりと専用のサウンドシステムが、音楽に集中できる環境をつくっている。"},{"id":"liquidroom","name":"LIQUIDROOM","city":"TOKYO","area":"EBISU","type":"livehouse","name_kana":"リキッドルーム","access":"JR恵比寿駅西口・東京メトロ日比谷線恵比寿駅2番出口から徒歩3分","access_en":"3 min walk from Ebisu Station (JR West Exit / Tokyo Metro Hibiya Line Exit 2)","image":"images/venues/liquidroom.webp","genre":["TECHNO","HOUSE","LIVE","OTHERS"],"capacity":900,"address":"3-16-6 Higashi, Shibuya-ku, Tokyo","lat":35.6491,"lng":139.7106,"url":"https://www.liquidroom.net/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/liquidroom_ebisu/","desc_en":"Situated in Ebisu, LIQUIDROOM stands as one of Tokyo's most respected mid-sized venues, hosting everything from international electronic acts to Japan's underground scene regulars. The club's sound system and intimate yet spacious layout have made it a consistent draw for both artists and dedicated ravers since the early 2000s. Its programming spans techno, house, and experimental electronic music with a curatorial approach that balances accessibility with underground credibility.","desc":"恵比寿に位置するLIQUIDROOMは、東京の中規模会場として長く支持されてきた。海外のエレクトロニックアクトから国内アンダーグラウンドの常連まで幅広く迎え、2000年代初頭からアーティストとオーディエンスの双方を引きつけている。テクノ、ハウス、実験的な電子音楽をまたぐブッキングは、間口の広さとアンダーグラウンドの信頼性を両立させている。"},{"id":"clubasia","name":"CLUBASIA","city":"TOKYO","area":"SHIBUYA","type":"club","name_kana":"クラブエイジア","access":"JR渋谷駅ハチ公口から徒歩10分、京王井の頭線神泉駅から徒歩5分","access_en":"10 min walk from Shibuya Station (JR, Hachiko Exit); 5 min from Shinsen Station (Keio Inokashira Line)","image":"images/venues/clubasia.webp","genre":["TECHNO","HOUSE","LIVE"],"capacity":800,"address":"1-8 Maruyama-cho, Shibuya-ku, Tokyo","lat":35.659,"lng":139.6953,"url":"https://clubasia.jp/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/clubasia/","desc_en":"A cornerstone of Shibuya's club landscape since the late 90s, CLUBASIA spans multiple floors with its main room hosting everything from techno nights to hip-hop showcases. The venue's adaptable layout and central location have made it a reliable stop for both local crews and touring international acts seeking a mid-sized room with solid sound.","desc":"90年代後半から渋谷のクラブシーンを支えてきたCLUBASIA。複数フロアを持ち、メインルームではテクノからヒップホップまで多様なイベントが開かれる。柔軟なレイアウトと立地の良さから、国内のクルーと海外からのツアーアクトの双方にとって、中規模の会場として定番となっている。"},{"id":"mitsuki","name":"MITSUKI","city":"TOKYO","area":"SHIBUYA","type":"club","name_kana":"ミツキ","image":"images/venues/mitsuki.webp","genre":["TECHNO","HOUSE","MINIMAL"],"features":["after-hours"],"capacity":200,"address":"Nagashima Daiichi Building B1, 1-22-12 Dogenzaka, Shibuya-ku, Tokyo","lat":35.6565,"lng":139.6957,"url":"https://mitsuki-tokyo.com/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/mitsuki_tokyo/","desc_en":"MITSUKI operates as an intimate basement club in Tokyo's nightlife landscape, known for its focused programming of underground electronic music. The venue maintains a stripped-down aesthetic that prioritizes sound quality and dancefloor intimacy over spectacle.","desc":"MITSUKIは、東京の地下にある小規模なクラブ。アンダーグラウンドなエレクトロニックミュージックに絞ったブッキングで知られる。装飾を削いだ内装で、演出よりも音の質とフロアの近さを重視している。"},{"id":"the-room","name":"THE ROOM","city":"TOKYO","area":"SHIBUYA","type":"bar","name_kana":"ザ・ルーム","access":"JR渋谷駅南口から徒歩約3分","access_en":"About 3 min walk from Shibuya Station (JR South Exit)","image":"images/venues/the-room.webp","genre":["HOUSE","LIVE","OTHERS"],"capacity":80,"address":"15-19 Sakuragaoka-cho, Shibuya-ku, Tokyo, Daihachi Toto Building","lat":35.6565,"lng":139.7016,"url":"https://theroom.jp/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/theroom_shibuya/","desc_en":"This intimate Shibuya basement bar operates as a low-key refuge for serious music heads, programming everything from deep house to experimental electronics. The space maintains a deliberately understated atmosphere, drawing a knowing crowd that values sound quality over spectacle. Its compact layout creates an almost living room-like intimacy between DJs and dancers.","desc":"渋谷の地下にある小さなバーで、音楽を深く聴く客層に向けた場所。ディープハウスから実験的なエレクトロニクスまで幅広く扱う。意図的に控えめな雰囲気を保ち、演出よりも音の質を重視する客が集まる。コンパクトな空間が、DJとフロアの距離をリビングルームのように近づけている。"},{"id":"oath","name":"OATH","city":"TOKYO","area":"SHIBUYA","type":"bar","hours":"毎日 20:00〜翌5:00","hours_en":"Daily 20:00–05:00","name_kana":"オース","access":"渋谷駅から徒歩2分","access_en":"2 min walk from Shibuya Station","image":"images/venues/oath.webp","genre":["TECHNO","HOUSE","MINIMAL"],"features":["after-hours"],"capacity":100,"address":"1-6-5 Dogenzaka, Shibuya-ku, Tokyo, B1F","lat":35.6577,"lng":139.6992,"url":"https://www.djbar-oath.com/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/shibuya_oath/","desc_en":"OATH operates as a DJ bar in Shibuya, maintaining an intimate setting where selectors can explore deeper cuts without the pressure of peak-time crowd dynamics. The venue's compact layout fosters close interaction between artists and audience, creating space for more experimental programming alongside established underground sounds.","desc":"OATHは、渋谷にあるDJバー。ピークタイムのフロアを意識せずに、セレクターが深い選曲を掘り下げられる環境を保っている。小さな空間がアーティストと客の距離を近づけ、定番のアンダーグラウンドサウンドと並んで実験的なプログラムにも余地を残している。"},{"id":"www","name":"WWW","city":"TOKYO","area":"SHIBUYA","type":"livehouse","access":"渋谷駅ハチ公口から徒歩7分","access_en":"7 min walk from Shibuya Station (Hachiko Exit)","image":"images/venues/www.webp","genre":["TECHNO","HOUSE","LIVE","OTHERS"],"capacity":450,"address":"Cinema Rise Building B1F, 13-17 Udagawa-cho, Shibuya-ku, Tokyo","lat":35.6615,"lng":139.6988,"url":"https://www-shibuya.jp/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/www_shibuya/","desc_en":"WWW operates as Shibuya's intimate livehouse where electronic acts perform in a room that prioritizes sound quality over spectacle. The venue's compact layout creates an immersive environment where the boundary between performer and audience dissolves, making it a preferred spot for both established artists and emerging talent to test new material.","desc":"WWWは、渋谷のライブハウス。演出よりも音の質を重視した空間で、エレクトロニックアクトが演奏する。コンパクトなつくりが演者と観客の境界を曖昧にし、実績のあるアーティストから新しい才能まで、新作を試す場として選ばれている。"},{"id":"o-east","name":"SPOTIFY O-EAST","city":"TOKYO","area":"SHIBUYA","type":"livehouse","name_kana":"オー・イースト","access":"JR渋谷駅ハチ公口から徒歩10分","access_en":"10 min walk from Shibuya Station (JR, Hachiko Exit)","image":"images/venues/o-east.webp","genre":["TECHNO","HOUSE","MINIMAL","LIVE","OTHERS"],"capacity":1300,"address":"2-14-8 Dogenzaka, Shibuya-ku, Tokyo","lat":35.6587,"lng":139.6956,"url":"https://shibuya-o.com/east/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/midnight_east/","desc_en":"One of Shibuya's most established mid-sized venues, O-East has hosted everything from indie rock to underground electronic acts since the late 90s. The space maintains a no-frills approach with solid sound and sightlines that work equally well for live bands and DJ sets. Part of the broader O-family of venues, it sits at the sweet spot between intimate club and proper concert hall.","desc":"渋谷の中規模会場として90年代後半から続くSPOTIFY O-EAST。インディーロックからアンダーグラウンドのエレクトロニックアクトまで幅広く迎えてきた。装飾を抑えた設計で、確かな音響と見通しの良さはバンドのライブとDJセットのどちらにも適している。O系列の会場のひとつで、小規模クラブとコンサートホールの中間に位置する。"},{"id":"bonobo","name":"BONOBO","city":"TOKYO","area":"JINGUMAE","type":"bar","subtype":"dj-bar","name_kana":"ボノボ","image":"images/venues/bonobo.webp","genre":["TECHNO","HOUSE","AMBIENT","LIVE"],"features":["after-hours"],"capacity":100,"address":"2-23-4 Jingumae, Shibuya-ku, Tokyo","lat":35.6746,"lng":139.7111,"url":"https://www.bonobo.jp/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/jingumaebonobo/","desc_en":"A cozy neighborhood bar in Jingu-mae that doubles as an intimate venue for electronic music. The space attracts a discerning crowd drawn to its carefully curated sound and unpretentious atmosphere. Its compact size creates an unusually close connection between artists and audience.","desc":"神宮前にある小さなバーで、エレクトロニックミュージックの会場も兼ねる。丁寧に選ばれたサウンドと、気取らない雰囲気に惹かれた客層が集まる。小規模ゆえに、アーティストと観客の距離が非常に近い。"},{"id":"forestlimit","name":"FORESTLIMIT","city":"TOKYO","area":"HATAGAYA","type":"club","name_kana":"フォレストリミット","image":"images/venues/forestlimit.webp","genre":["TECHNO","HOUSE","MINIMAL","AMBIENT","LIVE"],"capacity":80,"address":"KODA Building B1F 102, 2-8-15 Hatagaya, Shibuya-ku, Tokyo","lat":35.678,"lng":139.6771,"url":"https://www.forestlimit.com/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/forestlimit_info/","desc_en":"FORESTLIMIT operates as an intimate basement club in Shibuya, carving out space for experimental electronic music and avant-garde sound art. The venue's stripped-down aesthetic and carefully curated programming attracts artists and audiences seeking alternatives to Tokyo's mainstream club circuit. Its compact layout creates an immersive environment where the boundary between performer and audience dissolves.","desc":"FORESTLIMITは、渋谷の地下にある小規模なクラブ。実験的なエレクトロニックミュージックやサウンドアートに場を開いている。装飾を削いだ内装と絞り込んだブッキングが、東京の主流のクラブとは別の選択肢を求めるアーティストと客を引きつけてきた。コンパクトな空間が、演者と観客の境界を曖昧にしている。"},{"id":"vent","name":"VENT","city":"TOKYO","area":"OMOTESANDO","type":"club","hours":"23:00~05:00","name_kana":"ヴェント","image":"images/venues/vent.webp","genre":["TECHNO","HOUSE"],"capacity":400,"address":"3-18-19 Minami-Aoyama, Minato-ku, Tokyo","lat":35.6652,"lng":139.7129,"url":"http://vent-tokyo.net/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/vent.tokyo/","desc_en":"A intimate basement club in Shibuya that has carved out a reputation for uncompromising techno programming since opening in 2016. The venue's stark concrete interior and precise sound system create an environment where the music takes absolute priority over everything else.","desc":"2016年のオープン以来、妥協のないテクノのブッキングで評価を築いてきた渋谷の地下クラブ。無骨なコンクリートの内装と精度の高いサウンドシステムが、音楽を最優先する環境をつくっている。"},{"id":"circus-osaka","name":"CIRCUS OSAKA","city":"OSAKA","area":"SHINSAIBASHI","type":"club","name_kana":"サーカス大阪","image":"images/venues/circus-osaka.webp","genre":["TECHNO","HOUSE","BASS","OTHERS"],"capacity":200,"address":"2F, Nakanishi Building, 1-8-16 Nishishinsaibashi, Chuo-ku, Osaka City, Osaka Prefecture","lat":34.675,"lng":135.4989,"url":"https://circus-osaka.com/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/circus_osaka/","desc_en":"CIRCUS OSAKA operates as one of Osaka's key underground techno destinations, housed in a compact basement space that prioritizes sound system quality over size. The venue consistently programs cutting-edge international and domestic techno acts, maintaining its reputation as a serious club for dedicated heads in the Kansai region.","desc":"CIRCUS OSAKAは、大阪のアンダーグラウンドテクノを代表する会場のひとつ。地下のコンパクトな空間で、規模よりもサウンドシステムの質を重視している。国内外の先鋭的なテクノアクトを継続的に迎え、関西の熱心なリスナーに向けたクラブとしての評価を保っている。"},{"id":"club-joule","name":"CLUB JOULE","city":"OSAKA","area":"SHINSAIBASHI","type":"club","name_kana":"クラブジュール","access":"地下鉄四つ橋線四ツ橋駅から徒歩5分","access_en":"5 min walk from Yotsubashi Station (Osaka Metro)","image":"images/venues/club-joule.webp","genre":["TECHNO","HOUSE","LIVE","OTHERS"],"capacity":500,"address":"1st, 2nd, 3rd, 4th, and 5th floors, 2-11-7 Nishishinsaibashi, Chuo-ku, Osaka City, Osaka Prefecture","lat":34.6713,"lng":135.4979,"url":"https://club-joule.com/ja/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/clubjoule_official/","desc_en":"Club Joule operates as one of Osaka's key underground techno spaces, housed in a basement setting that prioritizes sound system quality over aesthetic flourishes. The venue maintains a stripped-back approach that lets the music define the experience, regularly hosting both international techno acts and Japan's leading electronic artists. Its intimate layout creates an intense dance floor dynamic that has made it a fixture in Kansai's techno circuit.","desc":"CLUB JOULEは、大阪のアンダーグラウンドテクノを支える会場のひとつ。地下にあり、装飾よりもサウンドシステムの質を優先する。余計な演出を削ぎ落とした姿勢で、海外のテクノアクトと国内の主要なエレクトロニックアーティストの双方を定期的に迎えてきた。親密なつくりが生む密度の高いフロアが、関西のテクノシーンにおける定番となっている。"},{"id":"compufunk","name":"COMPUFUNK RECORDS","city":"OSAKA","area":"KITAHAMA","type":"club","name_kana":"コンピューファンク","image":"images/venues/compufunk.webp","genre":["TECHNO","HOUSE","MINIMAL","AMBIENT","BASS"],"capacity":100,"address":"2F, GROW Kitahama Building (Kitahama Building No. 2), 1-29 Kitahama Higashi, Chuo-ku, Osaka City, Osaka Prefecture","lat":34.6904,"lng":135.5122,"url":"https://www.compufunk.com/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/djcompufunk/","desc_en":"COMPUFUNK RECORDS operates as both record shop and intimate club space in Osaka's underground circuit. The venue maintains a focused approach to analog-driven electronic music, with DJ Compufunk's deep knowledge of obscure funk, electro and early techno informing both the shop's selection and club programming. Its compact dimensions create an immersive listening environment that prioritizes sound quality over scale.","desc":"COMPUFUNK RECORDSは、大阪でレコードショップと小規模なクラブスペースを兼ねる場所。アナログを軸にしたエレクトロニックミュージックに絞った姿勢を保つ。DJ Compufunkによるファンク、エレクトロ、初期テクノへの深い知識が、店の品揃えとブッキングの双方に反映されている。小さな空間が、規模よりも音の質を重視した環境をつくっている。"},{"id":"noon","name":"NOON + CAFE","city":"OSAKA","area":"UMEDA","type":"bar","name_kana":"ヌーン","access":"大阪メトロ谷町線中崎町駅から徒歩5分","access_en":"5 min walk from Nakazakicho Station (Osaka Metro Tanimachi Line)","image":"images/venues/noon.webp","genre":["TECHNO","HOUSE","LIVE","OTHERS"],"capacity":100,"address":"3-3-8 Nakazakinishi, Kita-ku, Osaka City, Osaka Prefecture","lat":34.7071,"lng":135.5016,"url":"https://noon-cafe.com/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/noon_cafe_nakazaki/","desc_en":"A intimate bar and cafe hybrid in Osaka's Nakazakicho district that bridges daytime coffee culture with late-night music sessions. The compact space hosts DJ sets and small gatherings that feel more like private parties than formal club nights. Known for its carefully curated selection of underground electronic music and relaxed atmosphere that attracts both local diggers and visiting artists.","desc":"大阪・中崎町にある、バーとカフェを兼ねた小さな空間。昼のコーヒー文化と夜の音楽をつなぐ場所として機能する。DJセットや小規模な集まりが開かれ、形式的なクラブナイトというより私的なパーティーに近い雰囲気を持つ。アンダーグラウンドな選曲とくつろいだ空気で知られ、地元の掘り手から来訪するアーティストまでが集まる。"},{"id":"triangle","name":"TRIANGLE","city":"OSAKA","area":"SHINSAIBASHI","type":"club","name_kana":"トライアングル","image":"images/venues/triangle.webp","genre":["TECHNO","HOUSE","OTHERS"],"capacity":250,"address":"2-18-5 Nishishinsaibashi, Chuo-ku, Osaka City, Osaka Prefecture","lat":34.6722,"lng":135.4976,"url":"https://triangle-osaka.jp/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/triangleosaka/","desc_en":"Triangle operates as one of Osaka's more intimate underground spaces, housed in a compact basement setting that prioritizes sound quality over scale. The venue has built a reputation for carefully curated lineups that span deeper spectrum techno and experimental electronic music, attracting both local selectors and international acts seeking a more focused environment than the city's larger clubs.","desc":"TRIANGLEは、大阪のアンダーグラウンドな空間のひとつ。地下のコンパクトなつくりで、規模よりも音の質を重視している。ディープな領域のテクノや実験的なエレクトロニックミュージックにまたがる丁寧なラインナップで評価を築き、市内の大箱よりも集中できる環境を求める国内外のアーティストを迎えている。"},{"id":"sunhall","name":"SUNHALL","city":"OSAKA","area":"SHINSAIBASHI","type":"livehouse","name_kana":"サンホール","access":"地下鉄四ツ橋駅5番出口から徒歩約3分、心斎橋駅7番出口から徒歩約5分","access_en":"About 3 min walk from Yotsubashi Station (Exit 5); about 5 min from Shinsaibashi Station (Exit 7)","image":"images/venues/sunhall.webp","genre":["OTHERS"],"capacity":400,"address":"Big Step South B2, 2-9-28 Nishishinsaibashi, Chuo-ku, Osaka City, Osaka Prefecture","lat":34.6709,"lng":135.4984,"url":"https://sunhall.jp/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/sunhall.info/","desc_en":"SUNHALL operates as one of Osaka's essential mid-sized venues, bridging the gap between intimate club spaces and larger concert halls. The venue has built its reputation hosting both local underground acts and touring international artists, maintaining a sound system that serves everything from experimental electronics to harder techno lineups. Its consistent programming and accessible Nippombashi location have made it a reliable fixture in Kansai's electronic music circuit.","desc":"SUNHALLは、大阪の中規模会場のひとつ。小規模クラブとコンサートホールの中間を埋める存在として機能する。国内のアンダーグラウンドなアクトと海外からのツアーアーティストの双方を迎えてきた実績を持ち、実験的なエレクトロニクスからハードなテクノまで対応するサウンドシステムを備える。安定したブッキングと日本橋という立地が、関西のシーンにおける定番の場所にしている。"},{"id":"club-metro","name":"CLUB METRO","city":"KYOTO","area":"JINGU-MARUTAMACHI","type":"club","name_kana":"クラブメトロ","access":"京阪神宮丸太町駅2番出口直結","access_en":"Directly connected to Exit 2 of Jingu-Marutamachi Station (Keihan Line)","image":"images/venues/club-metro.webp","genre":["TECHNO","HOUSE","AMBIENT","LIVE"],"capacity":300,"address":"82 Shimotsutsumi-cho, Sakyo-ku, Kyoto City, Kyoto Prefecture, BF","lat":35.017,"lng":135.7727,"url":"https://www.metro.ne.jp/","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/metro_kyoto/","desc_en":"Metro has anchored Kyoto's underground scene since the early 90s, operating from a converted basement space near Kawaramachi. The club's intimate concrete interior and carefully curated bookings have made it a essential stop for touring artists and a cornerstone of Kansai's electronic music culture.","desc":"METROは、90年代初頭から京都のアンダーグラウンドシーンを支えてきた。河原町近くの地下空間を改装した場所で営業する。コンクリートの親密な内装と丁寧に組まれたブッキングにより、ツアー中のアーティストにとって欠かせない一軒であり、関西のエレクトロニックミュージック文化の中心のひとつとなっている。"}];

const ARTICLES = [{"id":"transcendence-2025-report","title":"Transcendence | 野外テクノパーティで見た次世代ジェネレーションの可能性","title_en":"Transcendence | The Potential of the Next Generation Witnessed, an Outdoor Techno Party","excerpt":"北相木村の森に響き渡る先進的なテクノビート。若き世代が創造するTranscendenceで、日本の野外レイヴカルチャーの可能性と未来を目撃した。","excerpt_en":"Progressive techno beats echoed through the forests of Kitaaiki Village. At Transcendence, an event crafted by a young generation, we witnessed the possibilities and future of Japan's outdoor rave culture.","category":"REPORT","date":"2025-06-20","author":"Masafumi Take","image":"images/articles/transcendence-2025-report.webp","festivalId":"transcendence","readTime":3,"tags":["Dj","Rave","transcendence"],"status":"published"},{"id":"post-20251120","title":"MUTEK.JP 2025 | 現地レポート WWWとO-EASTで体感した音と光の二日間","title_en":"MUTEK.JP 2025 | On-the-Ground Report: Two Days of Sound and Light Experienced at WWW and O-EAST","excerpt":"電子音楽の最前線を体験できるアジア有数のプラットフォーム、MUTEK.JPが2025年も開催。石橋英子やアルヴァ・ノトら世界的アーティストが、音と光とテクノロジーの融合による未体験のパフォーマンスを繰り広げた。","excerpt_en":"MUTEK.JP, one of Asia's premier platforms for experiencing the cutting edge of electronic music, returns for another edition in 2025. World-renowned artists including Eiko Ishibashi and Alva Noto delivered unprecedented performances born from the fusion of sound, light, and technology.","category":"REPORT","date":"2026-01-09","author":"Masafumi Take","image":"images/articles/post-20251120.webp","festivalId":"mutek","readTime":2,"status":"published"},{"id":"loa-lost-paradise-2026-info","title":"LOA | 茨城 鉾田 nalu beachでビーチパーティが8月15日開催","title_en":"Loa | On a hidden beach in Hokota, Ibaraki, a two-day beach party where you can dance the nights away.","excerpt":"かつて大洋村と呼ばれた茨城・鉾田の隠れたビーチに、28時間止まらないフロアが立ち上がる。夕日で始まり、砂浜で朝日を迎え、二度目の夕日で幕を閉じるビーチパーティLOA。海の家もない太平洋を前に波打ち際で音を鳴らす。","excerpt_en":"On a hidden beach in Hokota, Ibaraki—once known as Taiyo Village—a floor rises that never stops for 28 hours. LOA is a beach party that begins with a sunset, greets the morning sun on the sand, and closes with a second sunset. Facing the Pacific Ocean with no beach huts in sight, the sound rings out right at the water's edge.","category":"FESTIVAL&RAVE","date":"2026-08-09","author":"TECHNO JAPAN","image":"images/articles/loa-lost-paradise-2026-info.webp","festivalId":"loa-lost-paradise","readTime":2,"tags":["RAVE"],"status":"published"},{"id":"bondisco-2026-info","title":"BON DISCO | 兵庫・三田の森で26時間 DIYパーティが13年目の夏へ","title_en":"26 Hours in the Woods of Sanda, Hyogo: DIY Party BON DISCO Heads Into Its 13th Summer","excerpt":"兵庫県三田市の森を舞台に、正午から翌日午後まで踊り続けるDIYパーティBON DISCOが13年目の夏を迎える。全国から集まる40組近いアーティストと2つのフロア、そしてプールで身体を冷やしてまた音へ戻る、真夏だけの過ごし方がここにある。","excerpt_en":"Set deep in the woods of Sanda, Hyōgo, the DIY party BON DISCO — where dancing runs from noon straight through to the following afternoon — is heading into its 13th summer. Nearly 40 acts from across Japan, two floors, and a pool to cool your body down before diving back into the sound: this is a way of spending time that only midsummer can offer.","category":"FESTIVAL&RAVE","date":"2026-08-13","author":"TECHNO JAPAN","image":"images/articles/bondisco-2026-info.webp","festivalId":"bondisco","readTime":2,"status":"published"},{"id":"snow-mashine-2027-info","title":"Snow Machine 2027 | 長野白馬で開催 出演者とステージ構成を解説","title_en":"Snow Machine 2027 | Five Days of Riding and Raving in Hakuba's Powder Snow Confirmed","excerpt":"昼はゲレンデ、夜はアリーナ、深夜は村のバーへ。白馬バレー全域を舞台に、Patrick ToppingやRisa Taniguchiらが集うウィンターフェスSnow Machineが2027年3月に上陸する。滑って踊るだけの5日間が始まる。","excerpt_en":"By day, the slopes; by night, the arena; after hours, the village bars. Snow Machine, the winter festival that takes over the entire Hakuba Valley with the likes of Patrick Topping and Risa Taniguchi, lands in March 2027. Five days of nothing but riding and raving.","category":"FESTIVAL&RAVE","date":"2026-08-17","author":"TECHNO JAPAN","image":"images/articles/snow-mashine-2027-info.webp","festivalId":"snow-machine-japan","readTime":2,"status":"published"},{"id":"asia-festival-2026-second","title":"【2026年下半期】 | アジアの音楽フェスティバル&レイヴまとめ","title_en":"[2026 Second Half] | Asian Music Festivals & Raves: The Complete Roundup","excerpt":"夏の終わりから年末まで、アジアの野外シーンは止まらない。ソウル近郊の山でのキャンプイン、ウランバートルの巨大レイヴ、ヒマラヤ高地の初開催ギャザリング、バリのエコファーム、そして香港の10周年まで、日本から数時間で届く14のフロアを厳選して紹介する。","excerpt_en":"From late summer through year's end, Asia's outdoor scene never stops. A camping-in weekender in the mountains outside Seoul, a massive rave in Ulaanbaatar, a first-edition gathering high in the Himalayas, an eco-farm in Bali, and a 10th anniversary in Hong Kong — here are 14 hand-picked floors, all just a few hours from Japan.","category":"GUIDE","date":"2026-08-22","author":"TECHNO JAPAN","image":"images/articles/asia-festival-2026second.webp","featured":true,"readTime":3,"status":"published"},{"id":"forest-sound-camp-info","title":"FOREST SOUND CAMP | 東京の森で夜通し踊る キャンプ型レイヴ が9月開催","title_en":"FOREST SOUND CAMP | Dance Till Dawn in the Forests of Tokyo: Camping Rave Arrives in September","excerpt":"東京の西端、日の出町の森で昼から翌日の昼まで丸一日踊り続けるキャンプ型レイヴが9月に開催。Stones TaroやTeklifeのJackieら20組超が、VOID Acousticsの音とともに森林と音楽の共存という実験に挑む。","excerpt_en":"On the western edge of Tokyo, in the forests of Hinode, a camping rave running a full day and night — from midday through to midday the following day — arrives this September. More than twenty acts, including Stones Taro and Teklife's Jackie, take on an experiment in the coexistence of forest and music, carried by a VOID Acoustics system.","category":"FESTIVAL&RAVE","date":"2026-08-27","author":"TECHNO JAPAN","image":"images/articles/forest-sound-camp-info.webp","festivalId":"forest-sound-camp","readTime":2,"status":"published"},{"id":"rebirth-2026-info","title":"Re:birth | 2年半ぶり復活、長野・木曽の森で3日間のギャザリング","title_en":"Re:birth Returns | After Two and a Half Years for a Three-Day Gathering in the Forests of Kiso, Nagano","excerpt":"長野・木曽の森を舞台に、Re:birthが約2年半ぶりに帰ってくる。RroseやMathew Jonson、Kuniykiら国内外80組以上が集い、天然の霧に巨大ホログラムが浮かぶ3日間。日本独自のレイヴカルチャーが、再び動き出す。","excerpt_en":"Set deep in the forests of Kiso, Nagano, Re:birth returns after roughly two and a half years. Over 80 acts from Japan and abroad — Rrose, Mathew Jonson, Kuniyuki and more — converge for three days where giant holograms hover in the natural mountain mist. Japan's own strain of rave culture is on the move again.","category":"FESTIVAL&RAVE","date":"2026-09-08","author":"TECHNO JAPAN","image":"images/articles/rebirth-2026-info.webp","festivalId":"re-birth-festival","readTime":2,"tags":["FESTIVAL"],"status":"published"},{"id":"japan-festival-2026-september","title":"【2026年9月】 | 日本の音楽フェスティバル&レイヴまとめ","title_en":"September 2026 | A Round-Up of Japan's Music Festivals & Raves","excerpt_en":"With the cool air returning, September is when the outdoors feels best. From an orchard in Hokkaido to a Japanese garden in Akita, the forests of Nagano and the mountain valleys of Miyazaki, the calendar runs unbroken across the country — camp-in mega-festivals and one-night-only raves alike. Here's our round-up of the parties you need to experience this month.","category":"GUIDE","date":"2026-09-09","author":"TECHNO JAPAN","image":"images/articles/japan-festival-2026-september.webp","readTime":3,"status":"published"},{"id":"shifumiz-2026-info","title":"Shi Fu Miz | 香港の谷で16時間踊り続ける都市型フェスティバルが10周年アニバーサリー","title_en":"Shi Fu Miz | The 16-hour dance marathon held in a Hong Kong valley, marks its 10th anniversary","excerpt":"香港の摩天楼から車で10分、ライチの森に囲まれた元朗の谷で、正午から翌朝4時まで16時間踊り続ける。10周年を迎えるShi Fu Miz Festivalに、Chez DamierやDr. Rubinsteinらパイオニアとアジア各都市のコレクティブが集結する。","excerpt_en":"Ten minutes by car from Hong Kong's skyline, in a Yuen Long valley ringed by lychee groves, the dancing runs for sixteen hours straight — from noon until four the next morning. Now marking its tenth anniversary, Shi Fu Miz Festival brings together pioneers like Chez Damier and Dr. Rubinstein alongside collectives from cities across Asia.","category":"FESTIVAL&RAVE","date":"2026-09-13","author":"TECHNO JAPAN","image":"images/articles/shifumiz-2026-info.webp","readTime":2,"status":"published"},{"id":"otsukimi-2026-info","title":"御月民 OTSUKIMI 2026 | 満月の夜に始まる、北アルプスの麓の3日間","title_en":"OTSUKIMI 2026 | Three days at the foot of the Northern Alps, beginning on the night of the full moon.","excerpt":"中秋の名月に合わせて開かれる野外フェスティバルが、7年目を迎え新潟・糸魚川の池のほとりへ。EfdeminやAnthony Linell、.VRILら国内外16組が、北アルプスの麓の芝生で満月の夜から3日間をつないでいく。","excerpt_en":"Now in its seventh year, the open-air festival timed to coincide with the harvest moon relocates to the shores of a lake in Itoigawa, Niigata. Efdemin, Anthony Linell, .VRIL and 13 other acts from Japan and abroad will carry the night of the full moon through three days on the grass at the foot of the Northern Alps.","category":"FESTIVAL&RAVE","date":"2026-09-14","author":"TECHNO JAPAN","image":"images/articles/otsukimi-2026-info.webp","festivalId":"otsukimi","readTime":4,"tags":["FESTIVAL&RAVE"],"status":"published"},{"id":"synapse-2026-info","title":"Synapse Festival | 福岡・海の中道で初の3日間開催へ","title_en":"Synapse Festival | Set for First-Ever Three-Day Edition at Uminonakamichi, Fukuoka","excerpt":"10月2日からの3日間、福岡・海の中道海浜公園のなかにある泊まれる公園で、Synapse Festivalが会場を移して初の3日間開催を迎える。閉園後の国営公園に立つ3つのステージにGE-OLOGYやIdjut Boysら40組が集い、サウナや焚き火、朝焼けまでが一続きの時間として設計される。","excerpt_en":"Over three days beginning October 2, Synapse Festival moves to a new home — the campground-style park inside Fukuoka's Uminonakamichi Seaside Park — for its first-ever three-day edition. Some 40 acts, among them GE-OLOGY and Idjut Boys, will gather across three stages set up in the national park after closing hours, where saunas, bonfires and the break of dawn are all designed to flow as one continuous stretch of time.","category":"FESTIVAL&RAVE","date":"2026-09-21","author":"TECHNO JAPAN","image":"images/articles/synapse-2026-info.webp","festivalId":"synapse-festival","readTime":3,"status":"published"},{"id":"odyssey-2026-info","title":"Odyssey | 宮崎・標高1,000mの森と天文台に、九州の50組が集うローカルレイヴ","title_en":"Odyssey | A Local Rave Bringing 50 Kyushu Acts to a Forest and Observatory 1,000m Above Sea Level in Miyazaki","excerpt":"標高1,000mの森と天文台をまるごと使い、九州の50組超が集う3日間。10年の物語の第2章となる今年のテーマはRE:ROOTS、熊本地震の復興支援と結びつく。銀河村での開催は今年が最後、森と星空のフロアを行き来しながら山で朝を迎える。","excerpt_en":"Taking over an entire forest and observatory at 1,000 metres above sea level, three days bringing together more than 50 acts from across Kyushu. Opening the second chapter of a ten-year story, this year's theme is RE:ROOTS, tied to recovery support for the Kumamoto earthquake. This will be the final edition held at Ginga Village — drifting between the forest floor and the starlit one until morning breaks over the mountain.","category":"FESTIVAL&RAVE","date":"2026-09-24","author":"TECHNO JAPAN","image":"images/articles/odyssey-2026-info.webp","festivalId":"odyssey","readTime":2,"tags":["rave","miyazaki"],"status":"published"},{"id":"japan-festival-2026-october","title":"【2026年10月】 | 日本の音楽フェスティバル&レイヴ11選","title_en":"[October 2026] | 11 Music Festivals & Raves to Catch in Japan","excerpt":"紅葉が山を降りてくる、野外シーズンの最終盤。 10月は、一年でいちばん密度の高い月になる。群馬の森に3日間のストーリーを組むLabyrinth、10周年を迎える静岡のFRUE、京都の寺院と庭園を巡る100名限定のWonderfruit。定点として続くフェスティバルと、会場を明かさないフリーパーティが同じ月に並ぶ。\n福岡から高知、静岡、長野まで、いま体験すべき11のフェスティバル&レイヴをピックアップ。","excerpt_en":"As autumn colours creep down from the peaks and the outdoor season enters its final stretch, October becomes the densest month of the year. From Labyrinth's three-day gathering in a Gunma forest, to FRUE's tenth anniversary, to a 100-capacity Wonderfruit winding through Kyoto, right down to free parties whose locations are never disclosed — here are eleven happenings you need to experience right now.","category":"GUIDE","date":"2026-09-28","author":"TECHNO JAPAN","image":"images/articles/japan-festival-2026-october.webp","readTime":4,"tags":["festival.rave","guide"],"status":"published"},{"id":"ondoland1012-2026-info","title":"ONDO LAND | 10月12日に大阪駅5F「時空の広場」でテクノレイヴ！","title_en":"ONDO LAND | Brings a techno rave to Toki no Hiroba, the plaza on the 5th floor of Osaka Station, on October 12!","excerpt":"10月12日、月曜の祝日。JR大阪駅のホームを跨ぐ橋上駅舎の屋上、大阪ステーションシティ5F「時空の広場」が、18時から4時間だけフロアになる。出演はDaito Manabe、食品まつり a.k.a. Foodman、Kuniyuki Takahashi、machìnaの4組。うち3組がLIVE SETで臨む。営業中の駅の、最も人が行き交う場所で開かれるテクノレイヴだ。","excerpt_en":"Monday, October 12 — a public holiday. For four hours from 6pm, the rooftop of the bridge-style station building spanning the platforms of JR Osaka Station — \"Toki no Hiroba\" on the 5th floor of Osaka Station City — becomes a dancefloor. On the bill: Daito Manabe, 食品まつり a.k.a. Foodman, Kuniyuki Takahashi and machìna, three of whom will be performing LIVE SETs. A techno rave held in the busiest thoroughfare of a fully operational train station.","category":"FESTIVAL&RAVE","date":"2026-10-01","author":"TECHNO JAPAN","image":"images/articles/ondoland1012-2026-info.webp","readTime":3,"tags":["osaka","osakastation","rave"],"status":"published"},{"id":"labyrinth-2026-info","title":"The Labyrinth | 標高1,000mの森で、日本を代表する野外レイヴが3日間の物語を組む。","title_en":"The Labyrinth | In a forest 1,000 metres above sea level, Japan's defining outdoor rave weaves a three-day narrative.","excerpt":"10月10日の正午に始まり、12日まで。群馬・みなかみの宝台樹キャンプ場で、Mindgamesが主催するThe Labyrinthが開かれる。今年はARCHITECTURAL（REEKO）がふたつのセットを連続で、ATOM™ & TOBIAS.が初めて最終日のクロージングを務める。Petar Dundovのライブは10年ぶり。チケットはすでに完売している。","excerpt_en":"Starting at noon on October 10 and running through the 12th, The Labyrinth, presented by Mindgames, returns to the Hodaigi Campground in Minakami, Gunma. This year ARCHITECTURAL (REEKO) plays two sets back to back, while ATOM™ & TOBIAS. take on closing duties on the final day for the first time. Petar Dundov performs live for the first time in a decade. Tickets have already sold out.","category":"FESTIVAL&RAVE","date":"2026-10-09","author":"TECHNO JAPAN","image":"images/articles/labyrinth-2026-info.webp","festivalId":"labyrinth","readTime":3,"tags":["gunma","rave","labyrinth"],"status":"published"},{"id":"treak-2026-info","title":"TREKs | 京都・久多の森が、3日間だけ\"commune\"になる","title_en":"TREKs | For three days only, the forests of Kuta, Kyoto become a \"commune\"","excerpt":"10月10日の正午から12日の夕方まで。京都市左京区久多、渓流に沿って広がる大黒谷キャンプ場でTREKsが開かれる。ポルトガルからFlow Recordsを主宰するPenaを迎え、京都と各地のローカルシーンから27組。音楽のためだけではない3日間だ。","excerpt_en":"From noon on October 10 through the evening of the 12th: TREKs takes over Daikokudani Campground, a site spread along a mountain stream in Kuta, Sakyo-ku, Kyoto. Pena, head of Portugal's Flow Records, comes in as guest, joined by 27 acts drawn from Kyoto and local scenes around the country. Three days that are about more than just the music.","category":"FESTIVAL&RAVE","date":"2026-10-10","author":"TECHNO JAPAN","image":"images/articles/treak-2026-info.webp","festivalId":"treks","readTime":3,"tags":["kyoto","rave"],"status":"published"},{"id":"intergalactic-2026-info","title":"INTERGALACTIC | 東京・日の出町の森が、光とアートと音楽の別世界に変わる","title_en":"INTERGALACTIC | A forest in Hinode, Tokyo, turns into another world of light, art and music.","excerpt":"東京を拠点とするブティック型の没入型アート＆ミュージックフェスティバルが、日の出町のおおばキャンプ村へ。2つのステージでハウスからテクノ、サイケデリックトランスへ。森にはライトインスタレーションとレーザーが点在する。","excerpt_en":"A Tokyo-based boutique immersive art and music festival heads to Ohba Camp Village in Hinode-machi. Two stages run the gamut from house to techno to psychedelic trance, with light installations and lasers scattered throughout the forest.","category":"FESTIVAL&RAVE","date":"2026-10-14","author":"TECHNO JAPAN","image":"images/articles/intergalactic-2026-info.webp","festivalId":"intergalactic","readTime":3,"tags":["tokyo","open-air","techno","art"],"status":"published"},{"id":"topia-2026-info","title":"Topia | 千葉・外房、まだ誰も足を踏み入れていないコンクリート空間で地下レイヴ","title_en":"Topia | An underground rave in a concrete space in Sotobo, Chiba, where no one has yet set foot.","excerpt":"成田空港内の私有地や相模原のリニア工事地など、オフサイトで開催を重ねてきたTopiaが初の屋内会場へ。主催が「日の当たらぬ地下神殿」と呼ぶ千葉・外房のコンクリート空間に、Evian Christが2年ぶりに来日する。","excerpt_en":"Topia — which has built its reputation staging events off-site, from private land within the grounds of Narita Airport to a maglev construction site in Sagamihara — moves indoors for the first time. The organizers call it \"a subterranean temple where the sun never reaches\": a concrete space on the Sotobō coast of Chiba, where Evian Christ lands for his first Japanese appearance in two years.","category":"FESTIVAL&RAVE","date":"2026-10-17","updatedAt":"2026-10-17","author":"TECHNO JAPAN","image":"images/articles/topia-2026-info.webp","festivalId":"topia","readTime":3,"tags":["chiba","rave","trance","techno","secret-venue"],"status":"published"},{"id":"sawagi-festival-2026-info","title":"SAWAGI FESTIVAL | 日本を代表するローカルフェスティバルが、10年の節目を越えて山梨から群馬へ","title_en":"SAWAGI FESTIVAL | One of Japan's defining local festivals passes its ten-year mark and moves from Yamanashi to Gunma.","excerpt":"昨年10年の節目を越え、11年目を迎えるキャンプイン型の野外フェスティバル。2026年は山梨から群馬・東吾妻町のSUTEKI VILLAGE CAMPINGへ。2ステージにLIVE 6組、DJ 52組。札幌、大阪、北九州で現場をつくってきたDJたちが群馬の山に集まる。","excerpt_en":"Having passed the ten-year milestone last year, this camp-in outdoor festival now enters its eleventh edition. For 2026 it moves from Yamanashi to SUTEKI VILLAGE CAMPING in Higashiagatsuma, Gunma. Two stages, six live acts, 52 DJs. DJs who have built scenes in Sapporo, Osaka and Kitakyushu gather in the mountains of Gunma.","category":"FESTIVAL&RAVE","date":"2026-10-19","author":"TECHNO JAPAN","image":"images/articles/sawagi-festival-2026-info.webp","festivalId":"sawagi-festival","readTime":2,"tags":["gunma","camp","open-air","techno","house","ambient"],"status":"published"},{"id":"denki-bodhisattva-2026-info","title":"電気菩薩 | 頭上を飛行機が行き交う成田の木の根ペンションで、24時間のハロウィン・レイヴ","title_en":"Denki Bodhisattva | A 24-hour Halloween rave at Kinone Pension in Narita, with planes passing overhead.","excerpt":"2021年に東京で始まったパーティーコレクティブが、2年ぶりの野外へ。成田空港建設への反対運動の拠点だった木の根ペンションで、テーマ「中華ホラー」のハロウィン・レイヴが24時間続く。DJ MARIA.ら国内外22組が出演。","excerpt_en":"A party collective that started in Tokyo in 2021 heads outdoors for the first time in two years. At Kinone Pension — once a base for the movement opposing the construction of Narita Airport — a 24-hour Halloween rave unfolds under the theme of \"Chinese horror.\" Twenty-two acts from Japan and abroad, including DJ MARIA., are set to perform.","category":"FESTIVAL&RAVE","date":"2026-10-21","author":"TECHNO JAPAN","image":"images/articles/denki-bodhisattva-2026-info.webp","festivalId":"denki-bodhisattva","readTime":2,"tags":["chiba","narita","rave","halloween","techno","open-air"],"status":"published"},{"id":"japan-festival-2026-november","title":"【2026年11月】 | 日本の音楽フェスティバル&レイヴまとめ","title_en":"Japan Festival & Rave Guide | November 2026 CATEGORY: GUIDE DATE: 2026-10-30","excerpt":"野外シーズンが終盤に差しかかる11月。森のキャンプ場、駅前の路上、工場、橋の下、沖縄のビーチまで、場所の幅はむしろ広がる。東京から愛知、長野、宮古島、石垣島まで、秋から冬へ移る月に体験すべき9の現場をピックアップ。","excerpt_en":"November, as the outdoor season heads into its final stretch. If anything, the range of locations only widens: forest campgrounds, streets outside train stations, factories, the underside of bridges, even beaches in Okinawa. From Tokyo to Aichi, Nagano, Miyakojima and Ishigaki — nine parties to experience in the month where autumn turns to winter.","category":"GUIDE","date":"2026-10-30","author":"TECHNO JAPAN 編集部","image":"images/articles/japan-festival-2026-november.webp","featured":true,"readTime":6,"tags":["FESTIVAL","RAVE","GUIDE","NOVEMBER"],"status":"published"}];

